{"time": 1768230659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1232716231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo-6GYwqSGkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQjSDxczHcGZy5SUpwKAisYnoCCO-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMC-l87CZexpl1HhyNNcABnIGGwPHVqAJG3y1yc2Gpro78EYN8qa5jwa3fhjULpL05g,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1768230797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677957677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“诶？”那你废了个老劲在人群中对她释放了勇气术，还好这些狂热粉丝都没特别注意你们，蒂芙尼察觉到了自己受到了什么影响不过没有多加在意，“谢谢”随后伸出手碰了下之后才缩了回去，短短数秒过后法术的效果失效，你看着她低下了头，不过倒是发出了很明显的粗呼吸的声音，大概是格外的亢奋中"}
