{"time": 1768279247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392376038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "后巷的街道意外的看着格外规矩许多，没有城墙限制用地面积而建成的房子密密麻麻的向地平线延伸而去"}
{"time": 1768279258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775489835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=5E3DE2048EDAF225BA398BB0F9CA9C92.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTTRuWt2w3gSQD8i6ARyFULT3ZcLhjOhQMg_woo5buYyNmHkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQvn51IxUZyGsiqqvhsD66PXoCukWCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMMgQFlYbSrOIdZuMVOH7x14LK3jrLGzyZYcdaty9c6F6t4uDxd6DKgQ4fqNg5qTrDw,file_size=49870]"}
{"time": 1768279330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725881939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#放眼望去，竟是钢筋泥土的大地?"}
{"time": 1768279333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478208105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "当真正的在外巡逻时，某种回到了朴素生活的感觉油然而来，路边简单而老旧的菜市场人群来来往往格外的热闹，每个菜铺上只是简单的铺着发黄的布料就当与隔绝"}
{"time": 1768279407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200351772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "街道上行驶着的是格外小型的电驴，但事实上在外因为路边摊而导致拥挤的道路也格外与它般配"}
{"time": 1768279454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422173515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“确实……比城内看着顺眼不少。”和夜鸦并肩左顾右盼，留心一下其他人看自己的眼神"}
{"time": 1768279469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453166078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=006133735ACB81129E800E871975264B.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSqzS0LwDZU0W3YlULzVak52q-3bxjLrAIg_woo9Y7NrNqHkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQYI734YJhn3wtwOnYF--Z8HoCZ1uCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMMgQFlYbSrOIdZuMVOH7x14LK3jrLGzyZYcdaty9c6F6t4uDxd6DKgQ4fqNg5qTrDw,file_size=38475]"}
