{"time": 1768288521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028190425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢您……这里应该是安全的吧？”"}
