{"time": 1768655174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088063055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那个，你好”#举起双手表示自己没有威胁"}
{"time": 1768655237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843082255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“刚才的是你吗？”"}
{"time": 1768655322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608067056", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“额，是的，多有冒犯。。。不过我对你们没有恶意。。。只是这位露露女士对我同伴手下留情，看见现场这个样子第一时间将你当成了坏人，想要将她救走。。。”"}
{"time": 1768655382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777108828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“额，是的，多有冒犯。。。不过我对你们没有恶意。。。只是这位倒地女士有过一面之缘，看见现场这个样子第一时间想要将她带走。。。”"}
{"time": 1768655511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011624594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是吗........不用在意。嗯......我是来追捕她的”"}
{"time": 1768655631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260496740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“额。。。我不是想要干扰你，我也不知道她的身份。。。那个，不知道怎么称呼？我洛克萨尼。。。这个地上的女士犯了什么罪呢”"}
{"time": 1768655647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404895218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森不禁想到，这里护卫有什么用"}
{"time": 1768655664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764413405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#都被人当景点参观了"}
{"time": 1768655669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707132449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“修女.......你们是不是碰到过一样这么叫的人了”"}
{"time": 1768655711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "460114818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“清扫者，这样就好”"}
{"time": 1768655745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336014804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“额。。。修女不是一个人？而是一个组织吗”"}
