{"time": 1769779176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615929759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "前台找了一下账单，然后指了个房间给你，说是高点，其实也就3楼"}
{"time": 1769779214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110561570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（有传送门倒是无所谓，但实际靠脚进城那你麻烦就多了）"}
{"time": 1769779241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848325997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "确认一下门牌号，拿上两个苹果就准备去房间了"}
{"time": 1769779312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710342758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你想随手过去摸俩苹果，然后看见夜鸦已经在旁边的桌椅坐着啃上了苹果"}
{"time": 1769779389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142947024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "光看着外表来看这果子不像什么问题，不过顺着夜鸦啃着的果肉看就发现里面有着像是腐烂般的黑色色泽，不过并没有变软或者之类的变化，只是看着纯粹颜色不同"}
{"time": 1769779474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825472614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“夜鸦……”有些胆战心惊，不过没有喊得太大声，目不转睛地盯着她和果子，拽起她的另一只手“……我们先上去吧”"}
{"time": 1769779606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541027321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“唔........”夜鸦拿着被吃着小半的苹果跟着你一起上楼了"}
{"time": 1769779725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321159436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "开门进去，让她先坐下。皱着眉看着她，最后还是先叹了口气“……你好快的速度啊”"}
{"time": 1769779845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719526061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯？苹果吗”夜鸦边说边啃着苹果"}
{"time": 1769779876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554525438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "点点头，多少能猜到一点“和黑根有关吧？”"}
{"time": 1769779965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547017289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“有一点点感觉，我的话，没有关系的。但是其他人不清楚”"}
{"time": 1769780082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695233888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这些果子，感觉也不太像能从别的地方运过来吧”切开苹果研究一下，尤其是核“难道说黑根的化身就在这附近……？”想起亚麻说的传说"}
{"time": 1769780376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074572935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这里不是被用来做实验的吗？”"}
{"time": 1769780437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319090070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哇，她知道是实验，然后主动当试验品吗（）"}
{"time": 1769780512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966714555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（这里真正面向的实验是普世大众的平民甚至一定时间内运营没出现什么问题，对你们的影响，不好说）"}
{"time": 1769780516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624896552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也有可能，等明天的战斗过后，可能会有一些蛛丝马迹吧……不知道来不来得及”摇摇头“夜鸦有没有什么奇怪的感觉？”多少还是有些担心，看看黑根长多大了"}
{"time": 1769780643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40681762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "夜鸦边看着边虚握了几下手，忽然站了起来，你看到伴随着微弱的黑光她手中就握着了把黑光形成的剑。"}
{"time": 1769780664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079156811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“.........我很有这方面的天赋”"}
{"time": 1769780766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645365971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“倒也……不是担心你能不能学得会。不过这种来源不明还要在身体里扎根的能力，我很担心”"}
{"time": 1769780838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544978898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你看见你说完的时候她的手抖了一下，黑光剑随后消散了“只是稍微，会有些疼”"}
{"time": 1769780980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684759415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“等我们回去，就把那个摘了，好吗？”说什么都不敢让那个东西长下去了“想要这种能力的话，有的是更无害的办法”"}
{"time": 1769781097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697742463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "像是要制住疼痛般夜鸦深呼了口气坐回位置“如果不是被那个空间选上的人（指不是空间人），我的成长会需要长达数年吧”"}
{"time": 1769781176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269802803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“数年就数年，不算很久的”蹲下来摸摸她的脑袋“……因为想帮上忙？”"}
{"time": 1769781292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648239296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=D89B027DC844E2C59CA7DC2E20363DAF.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSR8g9YlA22vMkuSurzJlnFpRK2fhi1nAgg_woo3JCGirWzkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQyVKfcEwtfr3loLcCx-C8iXoCDkSCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMOhnN0jkxtsL1-M260V-9Blg9U_w8epeI5La882cO5eRcxkLXgiZaedJkK9u4DQ91g,file_size=134709]"}
