{"time": 1769867916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250822721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你这这附近逛了逛，逛到深夜10点，发现这里的楼房大多数都并非是专门为了从事商业化而准备的，模板都是从自建房改造，也就意味着，哪怕有仓库，外面恐怕也不太能看得出来"}
{"time": 1769867971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982462954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "以及你注意到了这里完全没有大点的资产就能支撑得起的商店，比如大型超市"}
{"time": 1769868012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168094901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "比如医院之类也同样不存在，转而存在的是小型诊所"}
{"time": 1769868015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743040904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo2NTYkvi1kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQXKuRsv7CXpqnW2EucIhCtXoCAV-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMOlpySVExuWbsu7z5sDNFnA_JEoFwKe_g1cSHlu5Vj5eAui9K4axDWlEdGmQHsZcFw,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1769868044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844318085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*没办法了，路上看看能不能碰见组织成员"}
{"time": 1769868099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "426456357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "比如顶着莫西干发型的人，且不在广场附近"}
{"time": 1769868113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052689479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "晚上时间帮派成员都在外面浪，广场那边没人聚着了，你也确确实实在小吃街附近有看到杀马特"}
{"time": 1769868184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570885209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那就挑一个落单的人坐在他对面“你好，这里没人吧？”"}
{"time": 1769868207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290816235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=5ADE12B78B33ED3EB78A55A8017425D7.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQh2WZxW0rMx-rBdwWY2W8nft0thBinqxcg_woow_Tb7fi1kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQbWy3iIkpheMK6eL1Hx8HB3oCleyCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMOlpySVExuWbsu7z5sDNFnA_JEoFwKe_g1cSHlu5Vj5eAui9K4axDWlEdGmQHsZcFw,file_size=382375]"}
{"time": 1769868239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706038160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=D60A1FAEF0D36666E4F37CDED90B3C7F.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSGskoS1QhSXDCv4UGWSN60f_4JLRiQ7hMg_woonZ-Z_fi1kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQaR6Yzk4jxSWWNzBfoLpq8XoCNZmCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMOlpySVExuWbsu7z5sDNFnA_JEoFwKe_g1cSHlu5Vj5eAui9K4axDWlEdGmQHsZcFw,file_size=325392]"}
{"time": 1769868267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465296560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“哦？这不是今天中午的两位小妹嘛，坐吧坐吧”杀马特毫不介意的说着"}
{"time": 1769868396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881842545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，是。大哥记得这么清楚？”点点头“那个，对组织里的事情，我还有一些不太明白的”"}
{"time": 1769868481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967294079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“什么啊，说吧说吧，别害羞，要说资历这块，我可也是有两年了，真可惜，我的摩托三个月前刚坏没修好，不然可以带你们逛一圈城里”"}
{"time": 1769868531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977647329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "他一边说着拿出了串有摩托车钥匙的环晃了晃，像是在打发闲"}
{"time": 1769868751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47840341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……之前老大说过的那个苹果”提出问题“我有点好奇，它和一般的水果有什么区别吗？”"}
{"time": 1769868762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748333974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“除了领取，还能买得到吗？”"}
{"time": 1769868945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177003817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“苹果啊，就是更养生还有防腐烂吧，据说可都是专门从总部运过来长在大棚里的，可健康了，别的地方可没有”"}
{"time": 1769868971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619532760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“就算不是冬天，光放个十天也不会烂”"}
{"time": 1769869011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143528271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“噢噢……虽然限量，不过每个人都能领得到吗？组织对大家真好”"}
{"time": 1769869050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "305502604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嘛，如果是专门开旅店什么的会多些份额，不过这就是要花钱的了”"}
{"time": 1769869090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408475905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可惜并不会机械维修）"}
{"time": 1769869159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061941108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……也就是说还是有办法买得到的吧？我妹妹，她挺喜欢的”"}
{"time": 1769869256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549415375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“那可就要和老大商量了，啊，即便是商量也要到周末发放的时候才能拿到。你的妹妹......”杀马特用着自己那五彩缤纷的指甲揣摩了下自己带着小胡渣的下巴"}
{"time": 1769869297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089585641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“哦，我记得是叫夜鸦吧。给”他从自己的兜里揣了两个苹果出来"}
{"time": 1769869334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876024214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我家里就我一个人，再加上其实也不怎么喜欢吃苹果，还有些多的”"}
{"time": 1769869434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550219311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这……”有些意外，不过先替夜鸦道谢“谢谢大哥”"}
{"time": 1769869554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463526988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“谢谢哥哥”夜鸦老实巴交的附和了一句"}
{"time": 1769869604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314616773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“没事没事”杀马特抿了下嘴唇，下意识的从包里抽出了烟来，不过撇了眼周围于是站起身来“你们有什么想吃的先吃吧，我出去一会”"}
{"time": 1769869649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048749561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“噢，不用不用……我们这就打算走了”"}
{"time": 1769869677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622977739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*自己也站起来，表达不必在意"}
{"time": 1769869836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346076894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "他也没说什么，只是指了指室内然后就出去了"}
{"time": 1769869988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596561668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“总感觉有些意外？”夜鸦跟在你身后说"}
{"time": 1769870613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573517444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，似乎外环的环境没有我们之前想象的那么……混乱”"}
{"time": 1769870833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706571970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“毕竟内外感觉是完全不同的社会呢”夜鸦似乎心有所感"}
{"time": 1769870973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362225561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“即便只是做做样子……看起来黑云的人也的确保留了一处允许善意存留的土壤”*打算返回旅馆去问问苹果的事"}
{"time": 1769871084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095036199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道明天会发生什么，到时候要不要帮个忙呢？”"}
{"time": 1769871118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478596724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不清楚，两边的事情都不太清楚”"}
{"time": 1769871139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504303401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这样下去肯定会有伤亡吧”"}
{"time": 1769871290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722649897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，也是没有办法的事情”摇摇头“没有争端的世界是不存在的。尤其是……他们争端的源头并不那么清晰可见”"}
{"time": 1769871431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948114607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我们的矛头得看得远一些才行”"}
