{"time": 1770210965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738768054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "室外的广场依旧，不过你能注意到聚集的人确实少了点，但女武神依旧在"}
{"time": 1770211139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418456260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道该不该说胸有成竹呢……看不出有什么特别有防备的地方”*牵着夜鸦的手“想不到什么特别的办法，静观其变？”"}
{"time": 1770211285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180252997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯........”夜鸦有些专注的看着"}
{"time": 1770211293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680902895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们等了一会大概是10点左右的时候"}
{"time": 1770211333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544206202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "听到周围的小巷中稀稀疏疏的有着人的脚步声，很快就有百来号挥刀舞枪的杀马特涌上了广场前"}
{"time": 1770211460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538640454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“来了……可这不就是正面猛攻吗？”有些傻眼"}
{"time": 1770211540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170257515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“玛连尼亚”一个像是领头的，瘦杆文化人抄着把剑走在前头，身上装着裸露身体出来的支架式外骨骼"}
{"time": 1770211574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716567240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（理论上圣树也算是国际主义）"}
{"time": 1770211592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875172645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*找个地方躲起来先"}
{"time": 1770211615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680859244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这块地今天之后就要归红手了，你们要是现在赶紧带着人滚出去，我还能当做你们早就跑了”"}
{"time": 1770211782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765582211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "而女武神没有多说话，装置铠甲的时候抓握着无柄的刀刃，只见刹那间那两人便打在了一起，那女武神身上明明貌似毫无科技成分，却能压着那葛瑞克"}
{"time": 1770211828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671951362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "双方的混混也立刻反应过来，拼作了团，不过显然在这场战斗中有着明显人数优势的红手胜算很大"}
{"time": 1770211944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107372287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "两败俱伤对自己来说也算得上好消息。趁现在往黑云领地深处去探探"}
{"time": 1770211992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558699028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "双方打的地上什么都是，不一会周围的巷子中又涌出像是黑云的混子四面八方的圈踢红云"}
{"time": 1770212033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1841844269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1107372287]你觉得所谓的黑云领地深处是？"}
