{"time": 1770215211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702168165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是我……敌人都退走了”声音还算镇定“您还看得清么？”"}
{"time": 1770215294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391207532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我只是.....有些走神。可以帮我清点有多少自己人死了吗”"}
{"time": 1770215384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874493090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”直起身来，清点尸体的同时收下魂"}
{"time": 1770215426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762361545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "早死都魂飞魄散了"}
{"time": 1770215502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "817703860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你清点了下52号人整整齐齐，包括你昨夜看到的那个杀马特，黑云在这里的人除了马连尼亚都死在这里了"}
{"time": 1770215691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55752302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(回顾了一下女武神原设)"}
{"time": 1770215699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071118055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(花开的越多越不像自己)"}
