{"time": 1770216783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440321538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她既没有疏散也没有召集人手（））"}
{"time": 1770216818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324758230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（他在这就那么点人手）"}
{"time": 1770216834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162370661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（而且都是来这里之后临时招的，所以才都是杀马特）"}
{"time": 1770216857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678007435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（也就是说，其实都是不靠近核心圈的人，同理红手的人其实也是这样）"}
{"time": 1770216935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756828998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（让我想想.jpg）"}
{"time": 1770216940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415089470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（至于疏散，她最多也就嘴上劝劝这些人不来这场必死的局，但个人威望高了其他人就跟着来自刎归天了）"}
