{"time": 1770380733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851411659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们跟着那位女仆在皇宫中逛了几圈，随后来到了皇宫外的另一间大房门前"}
{"time": 1770380856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58950129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "女仆敲了敲门说了句“客人到了.......”随后推开让到了边上"}
{"time": 1770380915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660709656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（等屋子里的人回应，jpg）"}
{"time": 1770381011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649629431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们只是等了下，就看到门从里边自己打开，里面是个宽阔的房间，内有人正坐在个无数被摆放在边上的素材中央"}
{"time": 1770381031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116127275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "然后整个房间看起来也是被各种各样的材料堆的密密麻麻"}
{"time": 1770381070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895336812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=121A6F1253B02F20234420C80471C381.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTVoA0mxIZ7atDeO3B5Ow_d3oVfrxi8lY4EIP8KKN2c-rXvxJIDMgRwcm9kUIC9owFaEKIAU8FTVduYiRy2072U-rN6AnqYggECZ3o&amp;rkey=CAMSMCkZSoGdn3KFyz9xuvTG8Vo9S2N-fYE_xX0hf1rFCSA0tEui_KjzX5OKRtzFRMUjrg,file_size=8620732]"}
