{"time": 1770477557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778953435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1935124531]（总之就是这句话）"}
{"time": 1770477580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521359797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1367603821]而图斯柯一言不发"}
{"time": 1770477716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801973213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1935124531]“总感觉今天没做什么事啦，可以的话，还是想做点什么。”揉揉眼睛，“真的很困的时候再回去好了。”"}
{"time": 1770477729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786584718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过我也没有想追究的想法啦，图斯科殿下，您可是第八王子，打起精神来呀，这样子低着头可不好”#醒完酒后给他们斟上一杯酒"}
