{"time": 1770481680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221659887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "但是过一两天你们的观点肯定就会变样，到时候就接着屁股决定脑袋了"}
{"time": 1770481706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662334305", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "说白了就是拿你们当镜子照"}
{"time": 1770481713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375810470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "说白了就是拿你们当镜子照自己"}
{"time": 1770481781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407351373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你不在他发问你观点的时候主动开个问他身世的观点，可以说是很爆了。而且还是种普遍很不尊重的话题"}
{"time": 1770481791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013602586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2135931761][CQ:at,qq=961142868] 额，我们都没有出去看过哪怕一眼"}
{"time": 1770481801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214690112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "问我们，我们也不知道呀"}
{"time": 1770481815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86732473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "反正我都没打算找第八王子"}
{"time": 1770481818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573393973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "而且其实就算你只考虑大臣，不考虑第八王子"}
{"time": 1770481859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192999847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你问这个问题就好像当着个孩子的叔叔面问“你是不是在家里挨80过”"}
{"time": 1770481866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093535250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "乐"}
{"time": 1770481870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914339278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "我不好说"}
