{"time": 1770730765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786099955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "然后你们就出发和三王子会面了，又是那个亭子里"}
{"time": 1770730811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67942493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“各位，这一天过来还适应吗”"}
{"time": 1770730814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125193889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=316161094]（当我拍了吧）"}
{"time": 1770730838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061890353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“还算适应”#点头"}
{"time": 1770730913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1377167777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，就是有些无功受禄的感觉”点点头“皇宫内还没遇上过不满意的事”"}
{"time": 1770731002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899959502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“那就好，如果需要的话要安排过些天离开王宫吗，一直在这里生活可能不适合你们”"}
{"time": 1770731291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92440856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“嗯.......说实话我们打算深度接触这个国家的王室，并为你们的王国提供一些帮助。当然，我们也想听听三王子的意见。”"}
{"time": 1770731312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370616556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“哦，对，各位找我是有什么问题吗”"}
{"time": 1770731397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447201820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“是，我们想和你聊聊有关其它王储，以及你自己。”"}
{"time": 1770731419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……这两天听了些流言，有些事也想听听殿下自己的看法”"}
{"time": 1770731471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225947932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是吗..........你们这些天的事我也有听说，有什么问题请问吧”"}
{"time": 1770731587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153869271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（他自己的问题我们最后说）"}
{"time": 1770731643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698836739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“八王子和五公主殿下回来了，我们昨天晚上有过一面之缘”"}
{"time": 1770731651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089941165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（等等）"}
{"time": 1770731657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651841951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（那个不确定是不是五公主）"}
{"time": 1770731664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483901750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（虽然大概率是）"}
{"time": 1770731670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118584937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（先当是了说.jpg）"}
{"time": 1770731707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689027382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是吗........没想到还能和他们见面”"}
{"time": 1770731716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807589494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“在这个时间点回我了，应该是为了继承人的事情吧。不过我曾听闻……他们和血族有些关系？”"}
{"time": 1770731799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576649180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯.........不止是这样”珈奇斯露出了可悲的神情"}
{"time": 1770731824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278497759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【嗯？】"}
{"time": 1770731959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795741520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“夜.......是晚来入宫的私生女，虽然实为第五公主，不过因为各种各样的原因在宫中论了后位。我想你们也有猜测，父皇也没有和我们直说，但我想她确实并非人类”"}
{"time": 1770732068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126119793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还是在野党.jpg）"}
{"time": 1770732153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885698252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“备受排斥的她，只好跟着当时还年龄尚小没有过多意识的图斯柯作为陪伴。后来......至少我认为，我不愿说兄妹的恶语，瓦罗刹找人寻来银剑，以及咒语亲自验证了夜的身份，紧接着.....”"}
{"time": 1770732274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183887059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“濒死的夜是由图斯柯救下，但也由于此事的冲突所以他们被干脆的要求离开了皇宫，紧接着是受到父皇要求被迫自愿要求放弃继位权的瓦罗刹，他也离开了皇宫”"}
{"time": 1770732328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562244451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "珈奇斯叹了口气“我知道事情就是这样了”"}
