{"time": 1771302137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642574879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=71018429]"}
{"time": 1771302198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110997765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（不过得你们先跑，现在我得去理东西准备上班）"}
{"time": 1771302234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998983819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们刚刚出门的时候看到了雷内正在门旁等着"}
{"time": 1771302239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626850740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是不是快到晚会的时间了？”"}
{"time": 1771302240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802619112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(有什么要动的先动吧)"}
{"time": 1771302292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1313286527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“雷内先生，今晚的宴会，你和渡星者阁下会出席吗？”"}
{"time": 1771302302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663760680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，我听说了你们的行程，所以就过来这里等着。”"}
{"time": 1771302332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763056444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“这样也好，要麻烦先生你了”"}
{"time": 1771302336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782021496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不，泽法还是和昨晚说的一样不打算出席”"}
{"time": 1771302426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714025162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你们呢？没有改变主意吧”"}
{"time": 1771302457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055017712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（泽法是谁）"}
{"time": 1771302462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367210828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（海贼王？）"}
{"time": 1771302471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578011424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（海贼王？）"}
{"time": 1771302476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025563453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……虽然大概无人在意我们，不过不会被赶出去的话，还是想去看看的”"}
{"time": 1771302493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492699950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（泽天（）"}
{"time": 1771302498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714618573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(不是泽天吗)"}
{"time": 1771302506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416551217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（打错了）"}
{"time": 1771302515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197770793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（就是泽天）"}
{"time": 1771302583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566106094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“虽然可能会有些危险，不过每位王子应该都不会介意你们的加入”"}
{"time": 1771302664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870593491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“okk”"}
{"time": 1771302690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329656988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森没啥意见，只是现在好奇那个叫窃骰的，难道和我一样吗"}
{"time": 1771302715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931593829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在几点了，是不是该出发了）"}
{"time": 1771302750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196351665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯........”雷内盯着你们看了好一会“时间差不多了，其实在进入会所之前我还有些事情要说，让我们在路上谈吧”"}
{"time": 1771302800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029748459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好的，麻烦了”"}
{"time": 1771302900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739216802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "他边走着边从兜里拿出个东西，看过去后便发现是个，齿轮机械结构的怀表，看起来格外的精细"}
{"time": 1771302996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493124505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#点头"}
{"time": 1771303018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837051142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这个是？”"}
{"time": 1771303077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125297258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“虽然只是学习了十几天拿出来卖弄的成品，但这个利用了泽法小姐的资源做成的怀表【汝等之事】可以稍微观察到世界的命运”"}
{"time": 1771303225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691087683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“世界的……命运？”感觉这两个词组在一起，相当厚重“雷内先生其实是天才吧”"}
{"time": 1771303245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728101381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“本来应该是这样的，但是昨晚我引入你们的命运的时候没有得到结果，这还是第一次”雷内说完之后收起了怀表，随后拿出了把看着金黄色的小十字剑，只有半个掌心大小，看起来只是模型"}
{"time": 1771303296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231289523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“毕竟我们是世外来客，不在此界之中”"}
{"time": 1771303306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773900534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，原神）"}
{"time": 1771303324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "912271167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“或许我们做了一些足够改变的世界的事情，你会看到新的可能性”"}
{"time": 1771303326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688159203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果可以的话，我希望你们带着它，作为信物可以容纳世界的命运，或许这样未来就会更明晰了”"}
{"time": 1771303337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087882843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我，我们吗”"}
{"time": 1771303360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258771801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#看了眼帕特森"}
{"time": 1771303365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40608285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“你拿着吧”"}
{"time": 1771303375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140527038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=691087683]“只是利用了前人的成果而已”他摇了摇头"}
{"time": 1771303383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1741089483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……雷内先生好像一直对命运很执着”看着怀表和剑章“可能有些冒犯，但是……我可以问问这有什么契机吗？”"}
{"time": 1771303503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633970194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=688159203]（啥意思）"}
{"time": 1771303517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031084254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（要我们去其他世界帮他收集命运？）"}
{"time": 1771303539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1091767714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（让怀表学习一下我们吧可能是）"}
{"time": 1771303549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341964028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（引入新变量.jpg）"}
{"time": 1771303582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193648362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森思索一会后接下吧，不会有点不舒服的感觉"}
{"time": 1771303594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "957552566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“只是奇怪，我作为生来的罪人，注定如此吗。听起来可能有些奇怪，不过我确实是位罪人。”"}
{"time": 1771303623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380679057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "接过十字剑模型之后你没感觉有啥不舒服的"}
{"time": 1771303631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323097382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“为何生来有罪?”"}
{"time": 1771303799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719626832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "雷内沉默着走在前头半响，终于开口“嗯.........我是被以魔女之罪处刑的母亲所诞下的孩子，这样简单的说明，应该各位也能明白”进行了这样简单的说明"}
{"time": 1771303856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419343525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我还好奇一事，雷内先生说，我们来之后就出现了观测不了的情况……也就是说，雷内先生之前试过了？这个世界原本的命运会是什么样的？”"}
{"time": 1771303960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138950485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“原来的命运.........是破灭与残渣，不过这种话不要和其他人说的好。”"}
{"time": 1771303988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549376130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（救世啊.jpg）"}
{"time": 1771303999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083230800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1138950485][CQ:at,qq=961142868] “是指这个国家还是整个世界”"}
{"time": 1771304053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310252230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“听起来有点那什么……不过，大概所有的世界总有一天都会迎来自己的落日吧，我觉得不该奇怪……不过到来的时间倒是确实值得关注”"}
{"time": 1771304064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87983418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是这个世界，现在的观测结果依旧如此，不引入你们命运的话”"}
{"time": 1771304147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676574374", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“命运何时会靠近我确实不清楚，但据说以前渡星者进行占卜时不是这种结果”"}
{"time": 1771304161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194317074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“命运何时会靠近我确实不清楚，但据说以前泽天女士进行占卜时不是这种结果”"}
{"time": 1771304199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490612539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“在过去发生了无人知晓的契机，让未来改变了”"}
{"time": 1771304243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684208652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#怎么感觉有点阴谋论"}
{"time": 1771304252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082192217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是的，至少我们观察的命运是可以改变的”"}
{"time": 1771304276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622510244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#不过咱们也呆不久，太久远也和我们没啥大关系，稍微帮帮吧"}
{"time": 1771304301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788865745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是轻易就能找到的东西呢……”看着那怀表，有些感慨“雷内先生也不是这个世界的人吧，也想尝试拯救么？”"}
{"time": 1771304329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410788353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这样说或许没错吧”"}
{"time": 1771304409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816540366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，类似的事我们也不是第一次干了，虽然……做的时候想的都不是世界那么宏大的东西”画一个圆“只是，希望我们关心的人，还有东西可以惦念，还能平安地活着”"}
{"time": 1771304429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800119590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总之……我想我们应该会尽力试试看？”"}
{"time": 1771304523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741366643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“真是感谢。”他说完这句话之后你们看到了皇宫内的宴会厅，里面已经显得有几分热闹，穿着礼服的人来来往往，相互交流，还有着不少女仆在端放食物与酒水"}
{"time": 1771304617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706372006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "而三王子也已经在里边了"}
{"time": 1771304672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123166124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森先观察一下里面的人有没有分成几个团伙，辨别一下派系“里面的重要人物可以麻烦先生你介绍一下吗”"}
{"time": 1771304770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "936917140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不必谢我们……说不定你们本来就能改变自己的命运呢？”摇摇头“以及，虽然我说不出个所以然，但我觉得血统论是错的。罪责与否不应该与出身相关”"}
{"time": 1771304779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900864563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "而你们进入宴会厅的时候也吸引了点注意，这时雷内保持着微笑和其他人打招呼，开始给你们介绍"}
{"time": 1771304958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164108459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“那两位就是第一王子法图纳还有护国公图耶尔”雷内看向不少贵族聚在一起交流的人群，其中你们能看到一男一女，男的是红色的头发与瞳孔（女的我就直接发图了）"}
