{"time": 1771305637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291633539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "最后他找了下看向某个角落，那里坐着独自喝酒的金发蓝眼，而右眼有疤的青年“那位便是瓦罗刹了”"}
{"time": 1771305706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564933341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#看一下他们身边有没有什么人围着之类的"}
{"time": 1771305790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189829306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "除了瓦罗刹，其他王子的周围都挺热闹的，除了扎克斯之外，都是在和贵族衣装的人聊天"}
{"time": 1771305879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056873971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(我们要散开搜集信息吗)"}
{"time": 1771305890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157469014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(都行)"}
