{"time": 1771307914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42250159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "帕特森感觉七王子提到焚天的时候脸上像是有明显的阴霾"}
{"time": 1771307940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160541384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1177043572]七王子独自喝闷酒了好一会，像是要忘记你一样的时候突然冷不丁丁的说“不，从最开始组建焚天就是我人生的污点。”"}
{"time": 1771307941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881103595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（散伙饭没吃上.jpg）"}
{"time": 1771307989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456540076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"稍微皱了皱眉，不会在这个时候开口打断他，继续听着。"}
{"time": 1771307992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353077537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（散伙饭没吃上.jpg）"}
{"time": 1771308040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271071257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(人生的污点居然不是把吸血鬼搞走了)"}
{"time": 1771308040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071318719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1663034109]“如果是我给的话，反倒会给你们添麻烦吧，而且明早我就要离开了，实在是吩咐不及”"}
{"time": 1771308161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718359350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“克劳蒂斯那家伙居然是魔物的养女，实在为人类蒙羞！”他说到这里的时候激动了一下，没好气的拍了拍桌子，本来这玩意看起来质量不错的，但这下直接连底下的地面干出了个裂缝，不过意外的是桌子倒是没烂，给现场的人都吓了一下。而你注意到他还没好气的瞥了眼护国公"}
{"time": 1771308205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352478057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2071318719]“可我们毕竟初来乍到，虽在这皇宫中，可与庶民无异”有些为难“甚至……可以说是居心叵测了。除了殿下，可能也只有渡星者阁下能为我们背书了”"}
{"time": 1771308419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892774111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"自己也有些被吓到，瑟缩了一下，重新安定心神，低头看了看脚底的缝隙，才开口，\"克劳蒂斯?魔鲸阁下...魔物的养女?这是...?\"至少脸上的惊讶不是演的。"}
{"time": 1771308431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87629508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "三王子这边也往七王子那撇了眼，随后叹了叹气“嗯，是的。”他挥了挥手叫来雷内“雷内，帮我通知渡星者阁下，今日过后加封森原华为皇宫卫队荣誉骑士，由于时间仓促，我会完成最基础的授权，接下来事就拜托她来办完吧”"}
{"time": 1771308460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "98422262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（唉，有点极端了）"}
{"time": 1771308478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1217312096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（瓦罗刹和人联想必有共同语言）"}
{"time": 1771308480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625663601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:face,id=16,raw=&#91;object Object&#93;]"}
{"time": 1771308649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550188156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是，她称号来由的魔鲸是过去平定曾经骚扰过南方海岸城市【高浪】的魔物之首魔鲸得来，没想到就是那家伙的养母！细查之后我才知道，魔鲸至今仍然存活。”七王子毫不在意周围气愤的说着，周围的气氛也就冷了许多，似乎他们这些冒险者即便是在贵族圈也小有名气"}
{"time": 1771308719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879382474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（又一个大佬）"}
{"time": 1771308764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011928977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“多谢阁下”鞠躬致意后，从侍者那边取一杯酒，看着气氛敬他一杯“愿前路天高海阔”"}
{"time": 1771308813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028597521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"殿下，这些事就算讲给我听，也不宜公开。\"语速依然很慢，语调很低，\"而且，换句话说，克劳蒂斯宁可让自己的养母销声匿迹，也要加入殿下的队伍。\"停了下来，等待对方的下文"}
{"time": 1771308999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012797453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1011928977]“而且麻烦对往后的我来说算不了什么了”他拿出酒杯和你碰了杯，然后喝了口“说希望未来再见，也不清楚好坏”"}
{"time": 1771309093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95206653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2028597521]“不用替那家伙说话，如果那魔鲸没有销声匿迹，我也早就找上门了。”他又一口闷喝下了杯酒，接着敲了敲你的酒“你呢，你怎么看？”"}
{"time": 1771309220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545004741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "举起酒杯抿下半口尝尝味道，\"我的意见吗？对哪一件事?\"若有所思的表情，看着酒杯里摇晃的酒。"}
{"time": 1771309352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340476172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2012797453]“总会变好的，凡事都会有收获”倒是相当乐观"}
{"time": 1771309378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941478304", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "瓦罗刹给你倒的似乎不是宴会酒，是自己带的，刚下口又辣又苦，格外的冲头，味大无需多言"}
{"time": 1771309385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126464384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1545004741]瓦罗刹给你倒的似乎不是宴会酒，是自己带的，刚下口又辣又苦，格外的冲头，味大无需多言"}
{"time": 1771309439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165572275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1545004741]“当然是魔物了，你成为冒险者是有原因的吧，比如某些贵族曾经因为魔物的袭击而灭族”"}
{"time": 1771309496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093595494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1165572275]“这样的事情穷之不尽，毕竟魔物就是魔物，魔族也是”七王子说话的时候又Q了一眼护国公"}
{"time": 1771309558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139591302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（说实话，我确实不理解让异形当护国公）"}
{"time": 1771309565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801654293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(人类至上主义者)"}
{"time": 1771309565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505393001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（不怕出事吗）"}
{"time": 1771309583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549951797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1340476172]“那么就让我们未来相见吧，呵呵”三王子突然一点也没有贵族风范的一口闷下了酒，摆了摆手去角落呆着了，没跟其他贵族说什么"}
{"time": 1771309591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474387078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "倒抽了口气，喉咙像是被强暴了一样连连咳嗽，过了一会才缓了过来，\"如果是我本人决定冒险的原因...仙仙只是觉得冒险很有趣。\"挂着些笑容，\"不过魔物确实是魔物，非我族类，其心必异。\"放下酒杯"}
{"time": 1771309622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "257507240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说实话，我确实不理解让异形当护国公）"}
{"time": 1771309632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "817956927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（但是吧，咱们四个都是拟人）"}
{"time": 1771309635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450503894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是一想到人类对同类做过的事情）"}
{"time": 1771309640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429234898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（不是人类）"}
{"time": 1771309642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871611365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我又觉得其实无所谓）"}
{"time": 1771309653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414542971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(我可以不拟人)"}
{"time": 1771309659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173635715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(我有完全人形)"}
{"time": 1771309680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906083657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(但是显然，白发金眼，也不是什么一般人。)"}
{"time": 1771309696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73449603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（长什么样不影响本质）"}
{"time": 1771309728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193392990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(人类自身怎么样那也是自家的事)"}
{"time": 1771309730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "563628164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1474387078]“是吧？”他露出了个笑来，看着倒是像个爽朗的邻家帅哥“对了，不过明明你有这样的实力却还是铁，还是位贵族，我觉得应该升上铜才对吧，有在公会里找过同伴吗”"}
{"time": 1771309743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "141624259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1450503894]（不过一般民众不会往这方面想，所以护国公到底是怎么选出来的）"}
