{"time": 1771311145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409891085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（七王甚至自己默认仙仙是贵族）"}
{"time": 1771311197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617573603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=854216787]“不不，我早就又被邀请了，只是对这里没什么喜好，才来的晚”他摆了摆手，继续喝着酒"}
{"time": 1771311325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273038804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1439857299]“是说雷内先生吗？以我愚见，他的才能倒是在我之上”*站到他身侧“我能做到的事并没有太多不可替代性。如果说我力量的来源处，倒可能另当别论吧？”"}
{"time": 1771311371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935922165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1186611773]“毕竟我们是来自异界之 人，有些许特别之处自是正常。”"}
{"time": 1771311439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275301935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=273038804]“不不，我看得出你很有才能”大王子闭着眼自顾自的点了点头“要不来我麾下吧，日后必定不可估量”"}
{"time": 1771311467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226256643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我，我吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1771311566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187495004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1617573603]\"嗯。\"点点头，\"还有这种酒吗？\""}
{"time": 1771311574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904905447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“殿下对于自己的国家，如何看待?您又打算如何改变它?”"}
{"time": 1771311661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336885621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1275301935]“殿下看得上我，我自然不会推辞”抬起头，有些意外地看向他，站到他身侧去"}
{"time": 1771311678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623846484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(感觉这大王子有刘备儿子之姿)"}
