{"time": 1771312204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191084714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "举起酒杯，\"敬什么?\""}
{"time": 1771312225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205831020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1336885621]他依旧闭着眼，点了点头，随后说“图耶尔，你先带她下去聊聊吧，我想你们应该有些好聊的？”"}
{"time": 1771312246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88175760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1873954597]（要我拦酒吗）"}
{"time": 1771312277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876141612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“您为什么如此自信天星宫可以自成一派，立足世界?这样您的对手可不止一国，而是与整个整个世界博弈。”"}
{"time": 1771312293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672540409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=191084714]“哈哈！致一切敌害灭绝的未来”七王子没多少讲究的举起酒杯和你碰了下，随后喝酒"}
{"time": 1771312327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660807608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“恕我初来乍到，眼见短浅，还望六王子解惑。”"}
{"time": 1771312377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083754308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=88175760](这随你嘛)"}
{"time": 1771312417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783007277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(七王倒是纯粹)"}
{"time": 1771312461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644024162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=205831020]没想到这么快就要离开会场，不过会场也有仙仙他们看着，应该没关系。点点头“悉听尊便”"}
{"time": 1771312484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186920559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1876141612]“是啊，你还不知道吧？我发现了大量的魔能矿，已经与院长说好改造了天星宫，在我回去的从此往后。天星宫将真正的立于天穹，世界之顶。”六王子有些亢奋的说着，如果不是真有魔法，恐怕会要认为是个中二病。“而这样的领地，未来绝不会只有一处”"}
{"time": 1771312523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082189130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(........)"}
