{"time": 1771312877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699326294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=482439821]\"今天就喝一点嘛。\"对着帕特森俏皮地眨眨眼睛，\"没喝醉过是不会怕的!\"声音高了些"}
