{"time": 1771314563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553363408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“小紫，她的祖辈都是无魔者，后来让我发现居然拥有着魔法天赋，所以就是这么回事，虽然有些人不会想承认，但即便是过去祖辈不曾拥有魔力天赋的人之中，也可能诞生天才”"}
{"time": 1771314644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77630124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“无魔者拥有着更加庞大的基群，如果能完善管理并不断挑选其中出现的人才，天皇宫一定能拥有更加光明的未来”"}
{"time": 1771314650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627007939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo5Ijio4XgkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQSPW40VxXUCRxe3f-2XBQ9XoCm6mCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMFB5VsPuBlxyK7-kWHcWkqjbCyPtMJk28TjDeiIqQ2p9Tp1vTiBWmVc6G_zcnHeekQ,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1771314677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437294404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（怎么某人一到打架就不见了）"}
{"time": 1771314685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247682099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#认同的鼓掌"}
{"time": 1771314697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766789621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(什么打架)"}
{"time": 1771314735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474822462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那么在您规划的未来里，无魔者该从事什么样的职业?”"}
{"time": 1771314739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490609208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=249454704]（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] ）"}
{"time": 1771314762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794635974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“貌似看起来，魔法师们能做的远比无魔者多的多。”"}
{"time": 1771314872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590548673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1764650427]\"赌徒...赌徒也很厉害吧？\"摇摇头，有些费力，\"帕特森这种，一直赢，很厉害...\""}
{"time": 1771314915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868503407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=474822462]“该怎么样就怎么样能活着并且不断繁殖就好，说到底重要的只是里面的人才”六王子看起来格外不在意的挥不挥手，也对这个话题没什么耐心"}
{"time": 1771315014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826161573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(繁育工具，意料之中。)"}
{"time": 1771315059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290646770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(这样只会导致畸形的未来)"}
{"time": 1771315088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713061203", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（他不在乎，也无异议，刻意培育，只是觉得这东西春风吹又生）"}
{"time": 1771315099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534887190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（他不在乎，也无意刻意培育，只是觉得这东西春风吹又生）"}
{"time": 1771315123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86175135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(说白了，还是当耗材的态度)"}
{"time": 1771315134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801602016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(他作为贵族压根不在乎。)"}
{"time": 1771315157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150760459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=590548673]“是吗？”七王子又喝了杯酒，看起来喝了好几杯都没啥影响“不过我可不经常去那种地方”"}
{"time": 1771315182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027029242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#没有点头也没有摇头"}
{"time": 1771315207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777109061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“感谢六王子为我解惑，那么咱们先聊到这里”"}
{"time": 1771315230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039673083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"很厉害就是很厉害吧？\"试图叉着腰，一副说教的口吻"}
{"time": 1771315232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612579570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“如果我想进入天星宫，我该找谁?”"}
{"time": 1771315336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659646900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=150760459] “会长，不过窃骰人怎么样，有点想见见”#喝酒"}
{"time": 1771315420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323611164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1612579570]“嗯.....确实，之后恐怕就不好进去了。但也会有专门的准备如果你一直在皇宫，或者说只要稍微打听就会知道的”"}
{"time": 1771315434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934056514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（想必是个大姐姐吧）"}
