{"time": 1771316295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103845484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#嗯，帕特森思索一下后向着他道谢，打算之后去赌场康康"}
