{"time": 1771334009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1510811806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那么会长你曾经的哪些同伴除了窃骰，其他人都是什么人物，我这边加入冒险者还是感觉提前知道些比较好”#帕特森给他把酒满上，自己也满上"}
{"time": 1771334181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112217860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过我对冒险者还是很陌生的，要是会长方便的话，可以感受一下我的能力给点建议吗”"}
{"time": 1771334222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877889401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo5oW_mM7gkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQCjZrZLaHmLKB8jQaAP_foHoCYAOCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMOUSFZIsQmWMifGAWFD9PJ6oo5Cs9-iDNVCJ9DFubasdVLW4UvUMuaWf_A8m5RXmqw,file_size=39951]"}
