{"time": 1771337094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704743624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“与魔族夺而来的千年时光，让帝国已成为这世间最为庞大，强盛的国家”"}
{"time": 1771337096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051712225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（额，开幕雷击）"}
{"time": 1771337196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "129034111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“和平不会是永恒，不为人所知的千年契约也已即将终结”"}
{"time": 1771337456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442242390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“先人以己身化作魔神的祭品，开出了与现界反立的魔界，那是时空，时间万物都难以稳定，生物难以存在的空间，并将魔族尽数驱逐过去。”"}
{"time": 1771337563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651182209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“千年时光以来魔界即将崩坏，魔族也将获得重返现界的机会。”"}
{"time": 1771337672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924223109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“与此同时，魔界与之带来的时空断裂将影响现界，我们将难以想象未来的模样。”"}
{"time": 1771337736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764580521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#想到之前说的这个世界的命运走向毁灭衰败。。。不会是因为这件事吧"}
