{"time": 1771341260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1263877800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森看着渡星者“女士，您有看出什么吗”"}
{"time": 1771341291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385376875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"或者说，女士有拦住那个所谓魔王的信心吗？\"有些好奇地看着"}
{"time": 1771341401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108507566", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1984196106]护国公盯着渡星者，随后闭上眼和你说“现如今仍然留在现世的魔物与魔族都是武逆了魔神的命令的后人”"}
