{"time": 1771395909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523958687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "渡星者的离开让宴会顿时冷场了，大王子和华说了声明天葬礼结束之后再见，也就这样子准备离开了"}
{"time": 1771395947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36715551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（咦，我还以为我已经是打工人要跟这着走了）"}
{"time": 1771395964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265204432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以你们选好了么?\"耸耸肩，靠着安娜，\"似乎现在主线已经变更了?\""}
{"time": 1771395982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976815396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(跟随)"}
{"time": 1771395988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373868451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一个多小时吧)"}
{"time": 1771395988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913191690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“不好说”"}
{"time": 1771396010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041152818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我们的目标应该先是找个依靠，然后才是那个问题”"}
{"time": 1771396031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129649471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“另外要跟你们同步的是，六王子的问题”"}
{"time": 1771396054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997895530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=36715551]（又不是要急着打仗，这些天都是在皇宫，当然没那么赶）"}
{"time": 1771396059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1915498979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“他想依靠天星宫开创第二帝国，创造一个只有魔法师的世界”"}
{"time": 1771396071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518566222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“无魔者会沦为生育工具”"}
{"time": 1771396078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509749116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“差不多是这样。”"}
{"time": 1771396103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33778153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我现在其实很想找八王子聊聊具体的情况。”"}
{"time": 1771396108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102139176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=523958687]“我不用跟着殿下一起么？”跟了几步，有点像送客“毕竟我可能算……摇摆方，不放在眼皮底下也安心吗？”"}
{"time": 1771396119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140285042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“这种事情现在感觉都不重要了，先想办法改变命运吧，几个继承人没有一个脑子正常的”#小声吐槽"}
{"time": 1771396139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1686978688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉命运就在其中啊）"}
{"time": 1771396144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881551086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"七王子大概是纯粹的人类至上咯，麻烦。\""}
{"time": 1771396191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256020187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“所以，如果不考虑精神洁癖的话”"}
{"time": 1771396192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193380996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不然我们也没处找命运，无从下手啊）"}
{"time": 1771396198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708224822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“选谁都差不多”"}
{"time": 1771396198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638619935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“唉”#叹口气“第七王子崇拜救天勇者，先去了解一下勇者吧”"}
{"time": 1771396229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438676981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“但是六王子这一方的资源会很雄厚”"}
{"time": 1771396230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583452146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=102139176]“不用，在皇宫到底是珈奇他行事最方便，不过既然他已经决定退出，那就没必要避嫌了”大王子目送着第三王子在角落陌陌的离开了“而且他也确实是个好人”"}
{"time": 1771396231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684457290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森出去找一下侍从，看看有没有关于救天勇者的书籍"}
