{"time": 1771397423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475912148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(所以?)"}
{"time": 1771397435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126476939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（so？）"}
{"time": 1771397437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394480365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“三王子殿下”从背后追上“我已经加入大王子殿下的麾下了。不过……何必走得这么悄无声息？”"}
{"time": 1771397527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582858500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“几位王子的分歧，比我想象的要更……根本一些，靠外人恐怕很难光靠嘴皮子说动他们了”"}
{"time": 1771397817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005837515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woooc3yjLvikgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQWo7oy72TU9e9B8FQdrq_fnoC5P-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMECRq4PvU9tVUXpszJaAOTQ7b7wprKHFPUpaxM_2KAr7DdOpBag1sOhzXaCwG6QKNA,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1771397908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723740078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是吗？”三王子露出了像是在心想【确实会是这样】的神情“是啊，我们已经不是因为糖果就会开心的孩子了。”随后摇了摇头“我们都从父皇那里得到了奖励，然后变成了别的模样”"}
{"time": 1771397958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890725162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哇还有系统）"}
{"time": 1771397969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642138443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（老国王是什么系统管理员吗）"}
{"time": 1771398014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414373743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（在古代，拥有全收藏皇帝有多爽？）"}
{"time": 1771398021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62368502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“奖励？”歪了歪头“喔，我没打扰到殿下想别的事情吧？我看您方才好像……”"}
{"time": 1771398268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847251317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不，没什么。嗯..........不过事到如今，我也可以和你说说这件事”"}
{"time": 1771398438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025329659", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“在我小时，是图斯还在时的事情，收到了父皇给我的秘密生日礼物”"}
{"time": 1771398442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020502126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也希望能做点什么，不论是从不虚此行的角度……”手背在身后，没说后半句“感谢殿下的信任，我洗耳恭听”"}
{"time": 1771398449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071480189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“在我小时，是图斯还在皇宫时的事情，收到了父皇给我的秘密生日礼物”"}
{"time": 1771398605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645421510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯...........你应该看不到，但在魔力感知上应该确实能发现在我身旁有什么？”"}
{"time": 1771398800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938392748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯........她是在百年前被镇压，如今效忠于我的地妖精，掌管着土地的力量，不过因为各种各样的原因，现在它十分衰弱以至于无法维持形体。由于契约的原因我们现在说是同生同死也不为过。”"}
{"time": 1771398885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523617026", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我想你可能有些疑惑，我会说是的，千年以来事实上遗留在现界的魔族，魔物并不少，但是大多都因为某个原因而陷入了沉睡掩人耳目”"}
{"time": 1771398898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461949092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我想你可能有些疑惑，我会说是的，千年以来事实上遗留在现界的强大魔族，魔物并不少，但是大多都因为某个原因而陷入了沉睡掩人耳目”"}
{"time": 1771398965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737029673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（赫赫）"}
{"time": 1771398970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070730064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没点感知）"}
{"time": 1771398980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504567085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“因此世界上存在大量的地宫，基本都是那些存在的休眠所，如果不出意外未来我也会顺便调查”"}
{"time": 1771399057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921248131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "似乎是想到了什么，他又忽然继续说道"}
{"time": 1771399060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924253658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(还有隐藏任务)"}
{"time": 1771399090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329603300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“事实上据说在这个世界上还存在着魔族之外的某种大敌，但我并不知晓对应的情报”"}
{"time": 1771399117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973766535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "随后他就住嘴了"}
{"time": 1771399162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314878244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "(还有隐藏任务)"}
{"time": 1771399200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089059598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“妖精吗？仙仙可能会很感兴趣……不过，这么说来，其他的王子们应该也有各自的礼物吧？”"}
{"time": 1771399224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117806218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我想是这样的，但具体我并不清楚其他人的是什么”"}
{"time": 1771399559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "112385477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……那殿下知道附近有哪里有这样的地宫吗？”"}
{"time": 1771399668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925866074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果是说未探索的，我也不太清楚，不如说尤其是皇宫附近探索的比较干净”"}
{"time": 1771399717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244589908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明白了，殿下还是下定决心要离开吗？”"}
{"time": 1771399915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083605066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯........不过估计不会留下太好的名声吧，好了，今夜先到这吧”第三王子打了个哈哈就和你摆手离开了"}
{"time": 1771399944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414885695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，殿下再见”"}
{"time": 1771399978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452735445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（那么今晚休息之前还有事吗？）"}
