{"time": 1771402222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220439519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_wooiIXawcvikgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQvOl2CkkFmShnNGABFOfLzHoCPtaCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMMyPSpU6K5wkqrfw8xX_kLZTFzNaWmZENV5n8sC4Wub6vP1bm-CMWFCGVcVSqaX64Q,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1771402248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199769061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（rp）"}
{"time": 1771402269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027082717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#那么找人打听一下进入天星宫的事宜"}
{"time": 1771402280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496458317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#或者直接找六王子"}
{"time": 1771402313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "829768854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "反正已经听说过六王子的为人，虽然自己有些不耻，但还是决定见一面。"}
{"time": 1771402346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485860793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1334333555][CQ:at,qq=961142868] （勇者的吧）"}
{"time": 1771402369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "219526802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#六王子自己说皇宫有内应，应该不难找"}
{"time": 1771402438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28226778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "第六王子倒是完全没有走，人都散的差不多之后他和他那伙朋友才刚刚开始吃喝玩乐"}
{"time": 1771402455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367190827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1485860793]（第二天再给情报）"}
{"time": 1771402473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318617969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（第六王子没说皇宫内有内应，只是说之后想去天星宫总有办法）"}
{"time": 1771402487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100680722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(猫猫引荐一下吧)"}
{"time": 1771402513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822245435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=367190827][CQ:at,qq=961142868] （好的）"}
{"time": 1771402524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1977620652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“贵安，六王子。我想引荐一下我的一位同伴。”"}
{"time": 1771402577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70389119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#礼数不能少"}
{"time": 1771402599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "605566936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“这位是仙仙。也是我们之中魔法造诣最强的一位。”"}
{"time": 1771402649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589402587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我们打算进入天星宫，了解一下更多有关这个世界的事情。”"}
{"time": 1771402659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235601134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#指八王子透露的信息"}
{"time": 1771402667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898130526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"初次见面，贵安。\"牵起裙摆行个礼，\"我叫仙仙。\""}
{"time": 1771402763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1841146524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我都有听说，不过现在一看果然特别，嗯？”六王子看了看仙仙“你们俩人都很有才能嘛”"}
{"time": 1771402813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327595288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“啊啊，对了，我是第六王子扎克斯，来都来了，和我们坐着吃吧。你们来的异世界都是什么样子的？”"}
{"time": 1771402848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422955189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我的异世界吗?嗯......可能会与你们的认知大有不同吧。”"}
{"time": 1771402873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493435358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（把麻瓜当成生育机器，扎克斯biss）"}
{"time": 1771402888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948892768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"仙仙只擅长一些不精密的魔法，论造诣并不如玖茗。\"既然对方提了，那就稍微拘谨地坐下，\"我的世界和这里并无差异，魔王，王国，冒险，不外乎如是。\""}
{"time": 1771402919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90384938", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#隐瞒自己的历史，单纯叙述一个人妖可以共存的世界。"}
{"time": 1771402952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639585345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#隐瞒自己的过去，单纯叙述一个人妖可以共存的世界。"}
{"time": 1771402982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005234373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“应该是个很挑战你们认知的世界。”"}
{"time": 1771403100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1662047939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果是瓦罗确实应该会这么想吧，我对这些事情没什么避讳，不过说到底现在愿意入学天星宫的魔族太少了，对我来说很是苦恼，偶尔我也想看到些特别的天赋”"}
{"time": 1771403105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027424274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#有提到魔导科技和无魔科技，观察六王子的反应"}
{"time": 1771403150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075131670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“仇恨不是一个轻描淡写的事情，我能理解。”"}
{"time": 1771403173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947647809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们能注意到，第六王子这么说的时候他的同伴也不完全都同意，尤其是之前被介绍给你们的小紫"}
{"time": 1771403174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231844793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（不过第四公主拥护第六王子，感觉是一丘之貉）"}
{"time": 1771403208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670636819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（我现在好奇第二公主嫁给的邻国国王是什么货色）"}
{"time": 1771403236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634886287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在这个世界毕竟还是很难做到这种事，殿下。\"意有所指，\"七王子殿下就是很明显的例子。\""}
{"time": 1771403257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "861967179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“在我们的世界，也有仇恨，歧视，纠纷。甚至分裂，但据我所知，我离开前这些问题已经得到解决。但对于你们来说，这算是遥不可及的未来。”"}
{"time": 1771403318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1813514948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是吗？不过我听着玖茗的世界不也也像是圈了个农场的样子，我觉得像那样子管理魔族魔物倒也没什么坏的，那样的话就算是瓦罗也没话说了吧”"}
{"time": 1771403431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1303609528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“说起来这个，看现在这个样子法图继承皇位是再顺利不过的了，那倒是方便我许多”"}
{"time": 1771403439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206006771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说是圈养...\"不知道该怎么接这句话，\"殿下觉得什么样应该被圈养?\""}
{"time": 1771403521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203525865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“倒也并非是农场。我们同样欣赏有才能的人，魔族是需要经过严格审核才能被准予通行的。我们相当注重思想教育，那些没能通过的永远只能当无名小卒。无法被教化的与野兽无异。文明之所以为文明，正是法律与道德的普及。”"}
{"time": 1771403579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209128689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“没错，重要的是才能”"}
{"time": 1771403583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1491093898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“无魔的人类与野兽亦有用处，拥有智慧的种族在我们那里是被平等对待的。”"}
{"time": 1771403597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065004460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "六王子顺其自然的用自己的理念接住了这句话"}
{"time": 1771403606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363046901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#......"}
{"time": 1771403614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864361295", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“才能决定了”"}
{"time": 1771403618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233110706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【嘛.....】"}
{"time": 1771403626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691147619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“才能决定了未来会是如何的”"}
{"time": 1771403638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306670302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“就像蠢货理所当然的只能干农活”"}
{"time": 1771403684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221939873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【说不动这种人啊，这股讨厌的高高在上的感觉，就连古早的皇帝也没有给我以如此蔑视的态度】"}
{"time": 1771403687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083972162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“愚者也自然会跟随智者的指引，落后的自然就该臣服于先进的”"}
{"time": 1771403693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348092953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【看来还是我太幸运了。】"}
{"time": 1771403741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732768068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“......开拓前路的人倒是越多越好。”"}
{"time": 1771403743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877474656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果只是圈养...\"看向对方，\"殿下，牧民也是一种智慧才对...而且...有才能的人应当承担更多的责任，这...\"停住，等待对方回答"}
{"time": 1771403789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844527423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【事教人一遍会，我来说教怕是也没这个资格。】"}
{"time": 1771403817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608104684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“没错，像我们这样的天才也理当负起指引世界的职责”"}
{"time": 1771403850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374188933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“正所谓能力越大，责任越大”"}
{"time": 1771403904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409185320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“不过我要说的是才能有时也并非决定一切，愚人们也能撬动世界的天平，他们所做的事情不比我们少，但或许确实不如我们多。六王子这样的天才大概会发现那一天的吧。”"}
{"time": 1771403953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368994952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "第六王子在准备说出下一句话之前随意的扫眼了一下周围，你们能看见现在在场的只有你们了“我不打算未来让更多蠢才参与所谓的管理了，无论是分类血脉还是什么的都太庸俗，唯有才能才是。”"}
{"time": 1771403980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970832504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【看来也不是所有人认同他。】"}
{"time": 1771403994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078758172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "指其他贵族什么的都离开了"}
{"time": 1771404005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240529406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "只有第六王子，还有他的伙伴，以及你们"}
{"time": 1771404021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566995630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自知在这种个体之间的差距过大的世界，有些话确实有些不算适用，拉了拉玖茗，六王子的态度虽然不合心意，但也挑不出理，叹了口气，\"殿下说的是，但先前所说有关学院独立一事?\"挑开另一个话题"}
{"time": 1771404030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127622373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“实力的确是恒古不变的道理。”"}
{"time": 1771404099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "936338430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“学院独立？那是当然的了，如果说是现在也没人有权管理我们，不认为是正好的吗？”"}
{"time": 1771404130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044464622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“再过些时间，哪怕法图继位，也没那精力来反对我们”"}
{"time": 1771404292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276564161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"权力更迭，版图变更在所难免。\"先口头表示认同，虽然并不看好，\"殿下对宴会末尾联合的声明是如何看待?\""}
{"time": 1771404346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718536394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“当然了，我认为合情合理，天星宫也自然会参与”"}
{"time": 1771404375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649276989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我对无论是毁灭世界，还是修复世界都很感兴趣”"}
{"time": 1771404429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177824863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#玖茗点头"}
{"time": 1771404453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577658864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#对于联合的事情持认可态度"}
{"time": 1771404638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788726006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不过话又说回来，虽说冒险者协会大多都是莽撞的人，但就让瓦罗继续这么莽撞下去可不是个好事”第六王子这么说着，继续和自己的同伴吃喝，没有继续做出下文"}
{"time": 1771404698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442080371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"既然如此，我也没有异议。\"停顿了一下，\"仙仙有个请求，不知殿下可否带我阅览学习一二天星宫的魔法?\""}
{"time": 1771404789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25704950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我倒是认为七王子是个值得拉拢的对象。”"}
{"time": 1771404878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929374887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“冒险者和法师协同作战是个有效降低遇见魔物暴毙的选择。”"}
{"time": 1771404923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498356610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“在一些苦差事上，冒险者能荡平许多阻碍。”"}
{"time": 1771404960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441963792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "第六王子没应玖茗的话“要想去天星宫也容易，不过这几天可没这个空余”"}
{"time": 1771405006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319123067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...殿下可能拨冗为仙仙指派一位老师?\""}
{"time": 1771405096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004134273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#对此感兴趣"}
{"time": 1771405120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508420447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是吗？虽然我倒是不介意，不过过了明天再说吧，之后有人愿意倒是没什么，葬礼的时候你就跟着我们吧”"}
{"time": 1771405164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018143202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那我也与她一同吧。”"}
{"time": 1771405213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084882341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【我倒觉得这人性格很仙仙挺像】"}
{"time": 1771405220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607886715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【都挺混沌。】"}
{"time": 1771405261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373853946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，要指导的也不是我，我也没打算随便指派个人，看谁乐意吧”六王子耸了耸肩，给自己的其他同行者笑了笑。"}
{"time": 1771405314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527940168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#并不在乎这些"}
{"time": 1771405350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560879290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就麻烦殿下了。\"起身，\"今天就不打扰殿下的雅兴了，明天见。\""}
{"time": 1771405356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867246556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#说到底，都是在试探。"}
{"time": 1771405373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52468705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#起身行礼"}
{"time": 1771405495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362948597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么你们也离开，没管他们吃吃喝喝了"}
{"time": 1771405522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758348085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#走到看不见的位置耸了耸肩"}
{"time": 1771405536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597746921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“都挺极端的。”"}
{"time": 1771405560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727998195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“不过也不关我们的事就是了”"}
{"time": 1771405573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162789535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“点到即止。”"}
{"time": 1771405576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399233648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（希望下次过来可以狠狠打他脸）"}
{"time": 1771405591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095745602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（他的态度高高在上，让我很不爽）"}
{"time": 1771405608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258025513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"至少还愿意合作对抗即将到来的灾厄。\"呼出口气，\"冒险家会长那边就。\""}
{"time": 1771405625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683090037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“顺便带我去注册吧”"}
{"time": 1771405632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103855152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我对那里也感兴趣”"}
{"time": 1771405644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621854300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（但是那个第四王女有希望超越渡星者，超越半神）"}
{"time": 1771405686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947426635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“会长那边.....嗯，我不被砍死就算成功”"}
{"time": 1771405715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708571773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过，要说我有没有完全信任留下来的魔族...\"耸耸肩，\"至少，要先确认一下。\"听完猫猫的话，\"行，你也顺便想见一见那个王子吗？\"在前面带路，\"可要收拾好才行。\""}
{"time": 1771405730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "893254815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=621854300]“不是已经见过了”"}
