{"time": 1771482280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035035264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*还是回去找护国公吧"}
{"time": 1771482298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580391597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们三人没受到什么阻拦的就离开了皇宫，看起来因为是，大城市的缘故，即便到了夜晚9点城市也 没有完全熄灯"}
{"time": 1771482348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382872067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*打听一下大王子在这段时间内下榻的地方"}
{"time": 1771482477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446331548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "沿着印象带着一行人去公会，反正待会还要见一面七王子，先开口给安娜打个预防针“安娜，待会还要见一次瓦罗刹。”"}
{"time": 1771482603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705479440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1382872067]显然也不是路边随便个谁都知道的，但你多问问还是顺利的问到了这件事，离你们住的地方有些距离，但确实是在皇宫里"}
{"time": 1771482693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118339843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "顺便你不知道护国公在哪"}
{"time": 1771482781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983805775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1446331548]“嗯......我没有问题的”安娜点了点头"}
{"time": 1771482799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324687605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=961142868] 我到凌晨可以查到勇者的情报，那么凌晨到早上的时间我看一下关于侦查聊天类的书籍）"}
{"time": 1771482807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642226787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（侦查聆听）"}
{"time": 1771482813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294912065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“国不可一日无君……老国王去世，王子们只顾着路线之争，怎么偏偏没个打算继位的”有些汗颜，不过想来明天也是葬礼，应该都会出席吧"}
{"time": 1771482826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890507314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（刷一下学识）"}
{"time": 1771482839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061884703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯。”点点头就不再说话了"}
{"time": 1771482848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983136965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（我说的就是差不多到别人醒来的时候你可以查到）"}
{"time": 1771482848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351610419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*事已至此，也许反倒该打听一下八王子的下落，去找泽天小姐好了"}
{"time": 1771482857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1491924526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（az）"}
{"time": 1771482921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896035006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "八王子的下落则是完全没有问到"}
{"time": 1771483010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381024641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1061884703]（你这边你要先自己聊，还是要等一下玖茗）"}
{"time": 1771483054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392097548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1351610419]然后你再次到了渡星者府邸，门还是和通常一般关着"}
{"time": 1771483086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554072346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（等一下吧，我无非是确认一下妖精的事情，咦，那也许可以先开口）"}
