{"time": 1771483267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574475436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=961142868] （我这边查到了消息就手镯发给仙仙）"}
{"time": 1771483323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308645600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=156388489]敲了敲之后，门口如常的自动打开了，渡星者正和第一次见的一样坐在大厅的正中央，不一样的是正在看着天花板上"}
{"time": 1771483342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221923028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=85490582]公会门压根就没关，24小时营业"}
{"time": 1771483462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817042218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走进去，指着猫猫去柜台，然后环视一下里面的人员，当然主要是找瓦罗刹"}
{"time": 1771483493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216576209", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "会长会长当然没有在站前台"}
{"time": 1771483498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235551247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "会长当然没有在站前台"}
{"time": 1771483532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626018733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（不在大厅里？）"}
{"time": 1771483562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100606803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "也不在大厅"}
{"time": 1771483583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265868954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小姐您好。”对着前台点点头，毕竟昨天才见过，“我和会长有约，他在这里吗？”"}
{"time": 1771483761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357466751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯.......仙仙小姐是吗？”前台看了看你“您的等级已经被更新至铜级，可以先归还先前的牌子吗？”"}
{"time": 1771483764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399968622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=308645600]“不好意思，深夜冒昧来访”看着她的样子，自己也抬头看看天花板“阁下在想什么？”"}
{"time": 1771483824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "576167632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=357466751]“啊...”没想到对方的动作这么快，把自己的小铁牌子递给她，同时开口询问“安娜的等级呢？”"}
{"time": 1771483876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83890380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“安娜小姐没有对应的安排”"}
{"time": 1771483947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836885260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "前台边说着收起了你的牌子然后递出了至少看起来是铜质的同款牌子"}
{"time": 1771483962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111178268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“知道了。”点头表示清楚了，接过牌子收起来，另一只握着安娜的手微微用力捏捏，“我可以去见会长吗？”"}
{"time": 1771483975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28110678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1399968622]你发现天花板居然能直接看到夜空，明明在外面来看这房子是不露顶的"}
{"time": 1771484163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497010947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“诸事不顺”渡星者看着天花板，看了好一会才垂下头来，摇了摇头"}
{"time": 1771484224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211709408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1111178268]“会长还在会长室，请现在过去吧”"}
{"time": 1771484229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522336657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“在2楼”"}
{"time": 1771484318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526903521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，牵着安娜过去"}
{"time": 1771484529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369350501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们三个人就这样子到了会长办公室门前，里边倒是能听到有些杂乱的翻书声"}
{"time": 1771484575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431383795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "敲敲门，轻声开口“殿下？”"}
{"time": 1771484681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908448649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“进吧，在外记得要叫我会长”会长室传出了声音来"}
{"time": 1771484808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "592269173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "推开门，先看一眼里面的装潢，“深夜造访，多有打扰，会长。”"}
{"time": 1771485092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893816119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=497010947]“是啊，诸事不顺……这是占星的结果，还是……显而易见？几位王储对继任好像都没有明显的兴致，反倒像是在……争个对错”"}
{"time": 1771485159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769910160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你看见第七王子正格外不雅的坐在椅子后，一手还摆在了桌子上，他手靠着的地方是堆积成山的纸案，另一边是他的剑，桌子旁还站着位男子正手拿着文件"}
{"time": 1771485393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749426686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1893816119]“他们真是和父亲一点也不像”她叹了一口气“占卜的结果”"}
{"time": 1771485438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698021827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "深知自己是不能改变对方的想法的，开口询问，“殿下明日会参加葬礼吗？”"}
{"time": 1771485652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127091964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“当然了，那可是父亲”第七王子对这个问题似乎没什么好脾气“你们怎么晚上出皇宫了”"}
{"time": 1771485704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003750441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1749426686]“由他们争下去的话，不知道什么时候才能有个结果……恐怕这个国家不一定等得了那么久”颇有些忧心“太多人踌躇满志了”"}
{"time": 1771485777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610492300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“一方面我们明天也打算离开这里，而我的这位同伴想要见一见殿下，注册冒险者的资格。”介绍一下玖茗，然后抬头看向他，“另一方面，我想请教会长一些魔物相关的问题。”"}
{"time": 1771485925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498129293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(来了，下班了)"}
{"time": 1771485967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458532747", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2003750441]渡星者也没多应回应这个话头“之后我要亲自处理我弟弟惹的麻烦了”"}
