{"time": 1771487067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383826319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯，玖茗来了。”扭头看着门口，“这就是玖茗了，会长。”"}
