{"time": 1771488178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144826002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "七王子稍微思索了一下说“元素妖精？是为数不多由于魔神的诅咒而会自然诞生的魔物，通常都很棘手”"}
{"time": 1771488195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "788114264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=859846658]（这么近.jpg）"}
