{"time": 1771488382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032001992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我听说那些妖精可以和人类契约?\""}
{"time": 1771488484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988511985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不不不，就像奴隶契约，实际上就算有也是人类这方准备的”"}
{"time": 1771488561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329116121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"原来如此。\"点点头，\"那会长知道那里可以找到炎属性的妖精吗？\""}
{"time": 1771488688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066152946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不清楚”他摆了摆手“有也死了”"}
