{"time": 1771489287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592610512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(嗯?我还有魂花哪去了)"}
{"time": 1771489293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344332526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"原来是这样。\"叹口气，\"我还想找一个炎属性的妖精契约一下。\""}
{"time": 1771489359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065294279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“打消了这种打算吧，哪个约束妖精身上不是血债累累”七王子格外有些不耐烦的应了句"}
{"time": 1771489389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435364563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2065294279]元素"}
{"time": 1771489401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693936230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"提起精神嗯了一声，\"对不起...\"自己已经没什么想说的了，看向猫猫"}
{"time": 1771489437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87881259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#思索"}
{"time": 1771489458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7844416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“七王子对于他们说的联合如何看待?”"}
{"time": 1771489533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514590210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我完全没有兴趣，谁知道他们说的是真假，本来也不就是群好东西”"}
{"time": 1771489588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810678124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“......但我想以您的性子，对于保护受灾的民众是责无旁贷吧。”"}
{"time": 1771489616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373937478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“和那群怪物没关系”"}
{"time": 1771489635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143614662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“......嗯?”"}
{"time": 1771489644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048323860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#我不明白"}
{"time": 1771489670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "580079021", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "字面意思都完全信不过"}
{"time": 1771489693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765264597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "字面意思的完全信不过，认为毁约是早晚的事情"}
{"time": 1771489707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667324754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“啊，我明白了。”"}
{"time": 1771489732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704732878", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“你认为这样的联合薄如纸船。”"}
{"time": 1771489737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521563534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“您认为这样的联合薄如纸船。”"}
{"time": 1771489786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406744948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，如果你是想劝我加入，那还是少费点力气吧”"}
{"time": 1771489860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115787528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我能理解，危机是否存在还要打个问号。现在考虑联合对您而言为时尚早。”"}
{"time": 1771489968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42482435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我有些好奇，关于冒险者协会的事情。”"}
{"time": 1771489991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "38816986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "七王子对是否会看实际加入这个问题不置可否，没有直接回应“什么事情”"}
{"time": 1771490013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019028879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“先前听闻您说冒险者协会精英云集。在这样的大陆，冒险者协会体量几何?”"}
{"time": 1771490089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40193792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#就是分布范围"}
{"time": 1771490099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332885635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#和密集程度"}
{"time": 1771490130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1435268321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我说你是不是搞错了些什么，冒险者协会可不是什么强制性的组织，虽然几乎遍布我们所知道的地方，但也不会改变这点”"}
{"time": 1771490198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664629053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“好的，我了解了。”"}
{"time": 1771490234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250246841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#看向仙仙"}
{"time": 1771490283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415193556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=39276DD57B99688371167641280CDCA1.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSTv20gUQFqkPpXsl2DiNacRvAZsBjjqwYg_woo8feSyJPlkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQAnMnUkxD7HTy5Y8dVn36tHoCkAmCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMHTEhaIRA6lQQkflWn3M9472VBk_ADYhesYrjDOfk-G7NW3GQUULlsOVr84hc4iviQ,file_size=103907]"}
