{"time": 1771490406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961882419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（冒险者协会未必有这个钱）"}
{"time": 1771490408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119919077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（只顾自己爽的渣男#不是）"}
{"time": 1771490421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557466451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（现在没人肯接任务，都很萧条了）"}
{"time": 1771490424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352691440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我觉得您如果在意，可以趁早准备。”"}
{"time": 1771490489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71405335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(就提醒到这里吧，听不听他自己的事)"}
{"time": 1771490534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455648255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（说白了还是钱的问题，冒险者协会作为组织主要还是持有钱，而不是粮食盐铁武器，再往上靠就是城主之类的事情了）"}
{"time": 1771490536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023265749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=5D6D1BDBFC7512F225EF8752ECD44F96.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTAju8lSMlplRS1GckRSzn3gDoHZhikzAUg_woomZXvwJTlkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQGfUCgWpxo8TpF9iCCv2sonoChvCCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMHTEhaIRA6lQQkflWn3M9472VBk_ADYhesYrjDOfk-G7NW3GQUULlsOVr84hc4iviQ,file_size=91684]"}
