{"time": 1771491639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912133814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1610999448]“晚上好，王子殿下”行礼“深夜冒昧来访，我也就直说了……我好奇殿下对那份遗嘱和未来可能的合作的看法”"}
{"time": 1771491761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951619162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看大王子殿下的态度，我想他应当是希望能有一个更包容的结局的”"}
{"time": 1771491811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685161926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“是啊”"}
