{"time": 1771491838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26642049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"深深点头，\"真麻烦\""}
{"time": 1771491839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411288883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“大概会成功吧，除了七哥不太认可”第八王子扶着门，露出了无奈的神情“大概会非对抗不合作”"}
{"time": 1771491902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960973655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不过毕竟只是冒险者协会”第八，王子移开了视线，不过你知道他的意思是【也就那样了】"}
{"time": 1771491916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048885986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“咱们也只能能做的就做一点了。”"}
{"time": 1771491946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40700946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“靠这帮人自己悟去吧。”"}
{"time": 1771491999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134439633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（赫拉克勒斯也就那样了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1771492166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634638497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=960973655]“嗯…私以为他所期待的未来，虽然说不上错，却也有些狭隘……合作能实现的话，不论谁是国王都好？我明白这有些冒犯。”"}
{"time": 1771492178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625630893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还想从这里能捞点好处呢。\"伸展一下手臂，看着月亮，\"结果基本是初次勘察一样的结果。\""}
{"time": 1771492247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411587330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我不清楚，要论交情，我希望是三哥”八王子直白的说道"}
{"time": 1771492304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190636163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“一抹黑，两眼瞎”"}
