{"time": 1771517396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961035734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（影子军全员跟着我们走就好了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1771517459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235403277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不了，葬礼过后我们就会离开，不该就这样漏于表面太久”"}
{"time": 1771517616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997724935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“还真是辛苦呢”#感觉她们是真苦逼，帕特森也不好强求，第一次见还是留点空间为好“行，咱们也算是认识了，以后想喝酒或者有什么要我帮忙的可以找我，要是我在的话不会推辞了”"}
{"time": 1771517630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458193694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"下一次见也不知道何时了。\""}
