{"time": 1771734927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952733887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“龙与那个世界法则存在特别的关系，作为研究的媒介是最好不过的”"}
{"time": 1771734941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810878348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“行”"}
{"time": 1771734962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386939074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“嗯.....带点赛博的东西给他们研究吧”"}
{"time": 1771734977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197681371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“咱们也没什么值得拿来交易的东西了”"}
{"time": 1771735018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035512983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1386939074][CQ:at,qq=2275904091] “还是不了，我们给他们的魔法其实早已经够了”"}
{"time": 1771735025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172695530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看向安娜，小声问她，\"嗯...安娜的治愈魔术学得如何？这次可要好好积累医生的经验呢...\"莞尔，\"毕竟这也是算是做好事?\""}
{"time": 1771735031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648818294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“嗯？”"}
{"time": 1771735036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045802811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“不吗”"}
{"time": 1771735074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790133274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“行吧。”"}
{"time": 1771735120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954951165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#但是考虑到会有恶战，姑且还是带上魔能装甲"}
{"time": 1771735127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957003938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#用不用另说"}
{"time": 1771735169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304007681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“之前学了些之后就很久没有进度了........真是抱歉，没法像仙仙姐姐还有大家一样学”（指土著除开突然顿悟很难一个月就长个几点学识）安娜听到自己要上阵，显得有些不安，不过还是立马打起了勇气“但是我会加油的”"}
{"time": 1771735207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846184219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#顺带一提，猫猫的装甲体型是70"}
{"time": 1771735230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449660172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#但是现在体型姑且不变还是40吧"}
{"time": 1771735266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003575179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#得想办法照这个世界的人要把剑耍耍"}
{"time": 1771735278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326232207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说不定龙血能当做战利品拿下呢？现在大家的水平也算能够独当一面了吧。不用太担心？”想了想“姑且是和我的故乡相近的星球，还是打算多介入一些”"}
{"time": 1771735324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32238374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“以前去过这个世界了吗？”夜鸦听着你们说话的氛围判断"}
{"time": 1771735330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "112418270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“对”"}
{"time": 1771735334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589365821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“去过一次”"}
{"time": 1771735364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908090999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我也相信安娜可以的。\"踮起脚尖摸摸头，加油打气，\"这个世界不算安全，但也称得上练手的好地方。\""}
{"time": 1771735366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146224407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，没有之前去过那个世界那么……嘈杂，不过也算比较现代”"}
{"time": 1771735371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979346159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“比起你们的世界科技稍微先进一个时代”"}
{"time": 1771735403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202279100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“但是远弱弱于赛博世界”"}
{"time": 1771735431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014793436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过魔法并没有很普及，甚至比魔女还隐世吧”"}
{"time": 1771735446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621933230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=908090999]安娜露出了个微笑，干脆直接抱住了你“仙仙姐还有大家在的话，我就没事的”"}
{"time": 1771735455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291232761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（忽然想到了安娜之前说的台词）"}
{"time": 1771735466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027191004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（我喜欢仙仙姐，还有大家！）"}
{"time": 1771735468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677475757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=843017363](忘了写进发表了)"}
{"time": 1771735473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973688065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“夜鸦先前都没有什么出手的机会吧？这次或许真的会碰到可以消灭的魔物”"}
{"time": 1771735488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626134688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我在的地方可是和刚刚回来的地方一样哦?\"微微抬高语调，\"谈及世界能不能稍微考虑一下我的感受。\""}
{"time": 1771735491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965092293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（当时和仙仙说完我喜欢你之后又跑出去和其他人说我喜欢你）"}
{"time": 1771735494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005440280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=621933230][CQ:at,qq=961142868] “我们都在这里，安娜”"}
{"time": 1771735496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836330792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那个世界真的有正常魔物吗”"}
{"time": 1771735505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513125084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#摸摸安娜"}
{"time": 1771735547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193172204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我们出发吧，各位都准备好了吗”"}
{"time": 1771735548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362750768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=626134688]“啊，所以仙仙难得地没有留下什么，临别的赠礼？”歪歪头"}
{"time": 1771735550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397476247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“之前你给我准备的修行法可能不怎么用得着了”夜鸦低下头伸出只手来，自己虚空张握了会"}
{"time": 1771735618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1993562258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"留下了被灼热的剑刺穿的尸体吧。\"没好气地开口，\"不过还是要多加小心，安娜。\""}
{"time": 1771735691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013623699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯”安娜连连点头回应你们"}
{"time": 1771735693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749025413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=397476247]“嗯……只能按你自己把握了”叹了口气“注意身体”"}
{"time": 1771735724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651659818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我没关系的”夜鸦说完之后，站在传送门旁等，等着跟你们进去"}
{"time": 1771735773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14212596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1993562258]“嘛，上次明明我也没有偷懒”伸个懒腰“别生气嘛”"}
{"time": 1771735866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877246137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"搞得像我是什么会乱来的人一样。\"摇摇头，\"那就，出发?希望气象不会有什么差错。\""}
{"time": 1771735877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063034489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“嗯哼”"}
