{"time": 1771744943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431366490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们在这巨大的城中行动着发现整座所谓的青铜城像是个立体的城市，大半的部位都没进了水中，只是探索了部分区域你们就废了一小时，发现这个城中真的是每处都是青铜所铸，不知道到底花了多少的资源"}
{"time": 1771744991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304956159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一共只有三小时时间，我们得速战速决。\"皱了皱眉，在一处高处指着城市中心，\"去那边看看。\""}
{"time": 1771745095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539621471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“去魔力浓度最高的区域吧”"}
{"time": 1771745181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984604890", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们在这个探索过程中倒是发现了不少被画得龙飞凤舞的字，然而你们完全不知道是在号什么"}
{"time": 1771745186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134021767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们在这个探索过程中倒是发现了不少被画得龙飞凤舞的字，然而你们完全不知道是在写什么"}
{"time": 1771745220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619759881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森看这些，记住画面吧"}
{"time": 1771745230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767063032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#拿出手机录视频"}
{"time": 1771745343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663620278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "当你们又再次走到了没水的空地的时候，夜鸦忽然站在水前说“我有个办法”"}
{"time": 1771745351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646360570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\""}
{"time": 1771745353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326503307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“什么办法”"}
{"time": 1771745454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929693283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“只要我的血淌进水中，我的感知可以跟着它延伸向很远的地方”"}
{"time": 1771745529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209204854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“细微的黑根会不断吸取魔力向周围延伸，但是因为过于微弱最终死亡在那之前，我们可以依赖它作为感知的延伸”"}
{"time": 1771745578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387709007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "夜鸦伸出了自己的手，站在水前，侧身看着你们，似乎是在征求意见"}
{"time": 1771745717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017307905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...如果要寻求效率的话。\"自己自然不会有什么意见"}
{"time": 1771745935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469494240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#看向华"}
{"time": 1771745940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948600997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过要注意一下身体，不行的时候让...子衿给你治疗一下。\""}
{"time": 1771745960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896550236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森再次开启魔力感知"}
{"time": 1771745989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155815272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "魔力感知还是那样到处堵塞，虽然并非不能用，但是处处都难受，没有良好的媒介效果差太多了"}
{"time": 1771746029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532862586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“没办法了”#把身上唯一一颗仙丹03给夜鸦"}
{"time": 1771746032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556263026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“小心点”"}
{"time": 1771746053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960114439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，小心点。\""}
{"time": 1771746060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935730632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "看着你们没提出什么反对意见“我会注意身体的”夜鸦点了点头毫不犹豫的用刀割开手腕，鲜血，不，从她腕中淌出的血显得格外的黝黑，粘稠，像是石油似的，偏偏不像血"}
{"time": 1771746134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072287463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"看向来时的路警戒，等待夜鸦的指引"}
{"time": 1771746163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2002086341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那黑血晕在水中，淡开来很快就什么都看不到了，而在帕特森的感知中则发现水中魔力的活跃反应提高了个档次，在这种状况上即便是自己也能不少程度的利用这个黑根作为感知的延伸"}
{"time": 1771746195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229422526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#那么帕特森也帮夜鸦一把，一起感知"}
{"time": 1771746205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962399274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯...........”夜鸦稍等下，连手上的伤都没治，回头和你们说“跟我来吧”"}
