{"time": 1771746422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930757954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "说完之后夜鸦也没管太多了，在水里游动着指引你们。你们跟着她片刻之后来到了个看起来格外广阔的前殿，路的两旁由青铜打造穿的像是古代官员衣服的人毕恭毕敬的向内朝拜，可谓怪异的是这群人都有个蛇脑袋"}
{"time": 1771746471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2097763711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“蛇人？这也算是龙吗”"}
{"time": 1771746492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485749677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#问一下随行了教授和那两个干员"}
{"time": 1771746502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652885479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "整条路在这里向着前方延伸而去，你们还能在边上看到又有个画的成团的东西"}
{"time": 1771746514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113737975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这不是蛇吗？\"皱着眉，指尖点起火焰照亮前路"}
{"time": 1771746544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057097232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，龙不只是最经典的模样，正如中国传说的龙生九子，含有龙血的生物是有各种各样的”曼斯教授解说的声音再次响起"}
{"time": 1771746589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170284405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#玖茗表示认可"}
{"time": 1771746621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102529638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“没翅膀的蜥蜴。”"}
{"time": 1771746691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561879110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这些东西....\"眯起眼睛，\"不够资格。\"火苗化作炽热的蝴蝶飞向前路作为路灯"}
{"time": 1771746757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894566665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“对了，刚刚你们看到的那个龙语，很可能是这片区域的地图，我刚刚已经上传了记录作为保存”"}
{"time": 1771746945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316875045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（开车）"}
{"time": 1771746950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742287980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（等我一会）"}
{"time": 1771746953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34095162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“前面的通道还是水”夜鸦走到路的最前边，和你们说道，你们也确实看到了最前面的路，还是水"}
{"time": 1771746956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567015384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（我跟随）"}
{"time": 1771747074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783118005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "这个时候夜鸦已经用绷带把伤口绑住了"}
{"time": 1771747077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718785020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "至少没有在流血"}
{"time": 1771747217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107623102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真麻烦。\"皱着眉，对着教授开口，\"我可以把这一片水都蒸了吗？\"蝴蝶盘旋在水面"}
{"time": 1771747304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688752866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "另一头沉默了片刻之后说“水很可能是构成青铜城机关的部分，我们不清楚蒸干之后的好坏，但至少水蒸气恐怕对你们来说很麻烦”"}
