{"time": 1771771923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93929555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森打个响指给他解除了"}
{"time": 1771771924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561394911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走过去扶起帕特森"}
{"time": 1771771943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878185853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“帅”"}
{"time": 1771771962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906145052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“真是谢天谢地，这里接下来就由我们来处理吧”"}
{"time": 1771771966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025553103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过，教授你刚刚说还有个事，什么事”"}
{"time": 1771771988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611133801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（下次去赛博世界，定制个高达线路）"}
{"time": 1771771999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759388856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（以后咱们就开高达）"}
{"time": 1771772002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134053344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，你们和我走”就在这时你们听到了有些耳熟的老成男人的声音，昂热从陆地里边走了过来"}
{"time": 1771772020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063460555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“还有这些东西，我们坐专机立刻回去”他指了指罐头还有匣子"}
{"time": 1771772023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685975547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我现在都没有力气了”#靠在仙仙身上"}
{"time": 1771772039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616099627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“哈哈，放心吧，飞机上有的是休息的时候”"}
{"time": 1771772048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1176142572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“嗯哼”"}
{"time": 1771772068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538848680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“行，不过我们才离开了一天吗”#帕特森有气无力的坐到飞机上，开始使用仙术恢复mp"}
{"time": 1771772084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73263792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "其他也累的要命的人，要么也去休息，要么又重新开始干活，拿起什么装备打碎冰块免得被人发现了"}
{"time": 1771772090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037515833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（仙术\n每轮恢复20mp，使用时减少意志骰及敏捷骰2点，每轮累加1点。当意志骰归零时强制结束。结束后三轮内回复全部意志骰。直到恢复前无法再次使用。）"}
{"time": 1771772134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855636494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，如果之后你们每次都只离开那么点时间就好了，在屠龙这件事上，你们真是好手”"}
{"time": 1771772161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166090382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“跟我来吧”他边说着向着陆地那边走去，你们注意到不远的路边上停着辆叫不出名字来的豪车"}
{"time": 1771772180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608492088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=855636494][CQ:at,qq=961142868] “啥好手”#挠头"}
{"time": 1771772192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440298126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "耸耸肩，\"\""}
{"time": 1771772196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666756419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"surprise\""}
{"time": 1771772205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99188259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我们这算好手吗[CQ:face,id=76,raw=&#91;object Object&#93;]”"}
{"time": 1771772271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737853223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大概算?无论代价的话。\""}
{"time": 1771772280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564444432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“当然了，我觉得你们值得信赖。虽然董事会那边可能不太满意”"}
{"time": 1771772301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892753345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森只能跟着“我们也不确定每次离开多久，我们起码目标一致，这次我们的目标是龙王”"}
{"time": 1771772312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881210471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“校长你那边有龙王的消息吗”"}
{"time": 1771772313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209156031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不过不用在意，只要我们的目标一致”"}
{"time": 1771772356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39186751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"既然你们无论代价，我自然也尽兴。\""}
{"time": 1771772401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618729496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“龙王？”昂热这白发老头的视线转了下“之后的时代可能不会平稳了，我们这不是正准备回去研究龙王吗”他点了点一手提着的大罐头"}
{"time": 1771772402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286956580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不论代价的话，我的想法和仙仙一样”"}
{"time": 1771772426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447425731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“这个就是龙王？”#用手指敲敲罐子"}
{"time": 1771772449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309211741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“准确的来说，应该是卵”"}
{"time": 1771772478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "746863936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“到时候有龙王了，分我们一点血呗。。。说实话我还是喜欢你们这个世界，还算是纯粹”"}
{"time": 1771772478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036852664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果能就这样子带回去，我们会有有史以来的，第一个龙王样本”"}
{"time": 1771772492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026040401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#想到了上一个世界各个拟人，感觉还是这个世界好"}
{"time": 1771772507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497138044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“当然了，这不算什么，只要有助于屠龙，你们也确实能做到”"}
{"time": 1771772512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124862096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那这个匣子?\"指着匣子"}
{"time": 1771772523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85009724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这个不清楚，带回去就清楚了”"}
{"time": 1771772533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002907451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "昂热一边说着带着你们上了车，他自己一脚油门就带着你们开始漂移了起来"}
{"time": 1771772549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648079107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"上面的裂缝是我干的 \"点头"}
{"time": 1771772570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990883946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是吗？那真是关于这个道具倒霉”"}
{"time": 1771772575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317202288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "昂热看起来心情不错"}
{"time": 1771772580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948936850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森吹个口哨“原本我还设想咱们这次过来间隔了数月数年的。。。那么教材需要更新吗，当初我们也算是小卡拉米”"}
{"time": 1771772615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200242720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果你们愿意帮忙的话，当然。现在有不少全世界教授正在分析研究，急得焦头烂额，如果各位愿意当这个导师的话”"}
{"time": 1771772615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081720776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我倒是希望能参与这个东西的研究，毕竟能顶住的东西可不多。\""}
{"time": 1771772722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233618520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那行，到时候我有时间就帮你们更新一下”"}
{"time": 1771772725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083162111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是吗？不过放心，我们会召集专家研究的”"}
{"time": 1771772781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134858594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（暴血：视为专家级变化系法术。消耗6mp/s，使自身力量，体质，敏捷增加50%（每项属性增加最多不会超过300），体型增加20%（不会增长过120），同时sc0/1，1%HP上限每s，之后每天回复1%HP上限。\n属性相关：体质加值达八点之后，额外消耗6 mp/s，使力量，体质，敏捷增加幅度增加10%（最大限制提高50），体型增加5%（最大限制提高25）。之后每三点加值同样。（力量，体质，敏捷最高提升到增加100%，最大限制1k；体型最大增加50%，最大限制500）。意志加值达10点之后，sc触发CD延长1s，之后两点加值同样。）"}
{"time": 1771772788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901013427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就，让我也参与一下?\"耸耸肩，坐上车"}
{"time": 1771772809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767664794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "这车飙了大概几十分钟你们就看到了城市的机场，昂热果断的停了下来“专机已经在等我们了”"}
{"time": 1771772837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978895917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“等回去之后两个都会安排人手研究，如果各位想参与我们也随时准备”"}
{"time": 1771772851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202598407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我那个乖乖的助手有来接我吗”"}
{"time": 1771772855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392700518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#乐"}
{"time": 1771772930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560303409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我就不好奇了。\"消耗了40的上限，加上原本用不了的20，自己还是有些累的。"}
{"time": 1771773013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488536237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"直飞卡塞尔?\"看了看身后"}
{"time": 1771773080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149922148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我想她或许刚刚知道，你们在下面冒险的事情被直播了过去，说不准正等着各位回去呢”"}
{"time": 1771773122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1021168273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“当然了，旁边的城里，然后再驱车进去”"}
{"time": 1771773144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214303188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“还有直播的事？”指了指自己，“我只是用了一下君焰，对吧？校长。”"}
{"time": 1771773159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299160791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#玖茗见队友积极交涉，闭目养神"}
