{"time": 1771854425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42512927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“也没多强嘛........”夜鸦小声反驳了句，然后回气过来说“黑根可以以他们的生命力为养料，到时候可以压制力量。”"}
{"time": 1771854442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212527395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“他们没有黑根的资质”"}
