{"time": 1771859163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960241605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“仙仙姐”"}
{"time": 1771859169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177795795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#自己联系一下拉洁娜“唉，晚上来我这边吧”#看了一下手镯“晚上一起整理一下资料吧，出现了变故。。。明天我们就要回去了，我会留下些法术之类的，或者说你要和我一起走吗”"}
{"time": 1771859329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343181381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"昨晚发生什么了?\"语气平静，带着些不易察觉的火气"}
{"time": 1771859409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683260701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“森原姐他们好像把入侵者处理了，之后有个叫楚子航的，应该是学长？带着药过来给你，但是好像因为体质较差，恢复的慢”"}
{"time": 1771859639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447691322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=177795795]“好，诶？回去的好快，我..........我家里那边”法洁娜犹豫了下这么说出来，那你也大概懂她的意思了"}
{"time": 1771859664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327434128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...谁打晕得我?\""}
{"time": 1771859683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997910823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不知道，听说是袭击者里面的人”"}
{"time": 1771859724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712172332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2113438381]“啊？我不知道啊.........什么那样的存在，每天抱着人喊哥哥的变态？那我确实受不了”"}
{"time": 1771859807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642193436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“被人打也不会死的，很恐怖的家伙”"}
{"time": 1771859854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610314480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=447691322][CQ:at,qq=961142868] “嗯”#自己也没有见过人家家里人，一起带走不切实“我这次带了书籍过来，晚上只能快速教导你了”#自己目前幻术专精，先教她幻术吧，一边想着一边回去，先叫她过来吧"}
{"time": 1771859914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581461308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“被杀也不会死？那我还真没想过，再打个几十年怕是星际争霸都要关服了”"}
{"time": 1771859951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402928153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...要是让我知道，我一定不会饶了他。\"从床上坐起来，摸摸自己的脸颊，\"我记得...好像脸很痛\""}
