{"time": 1771861300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004953385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1063303485]“……好了，现在。”找个被树影遮的严实的地方架好锅之后，坐下来看着夜鸦拍拍身边"}
{"time": 1771861326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924851293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#顺便拿出手机联系一下校长，问他在哪里"}
{"time": 1771861416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417795395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一定要给那个谁付出代价。\""}
{"time": 1771861423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966011010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1004953385]“............”夜鸦看着你的行动沉默着呼了口气，随后坐到了旁边“怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1771861473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972725475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "攥着拳，\"烦死了，下次绝对不会让安娜担心。\"掐掐安娜的脸，自己的脸总感觉烙下伤疤了，\"一点小伤，破了相也不碍事的\""}
{"time": 1771861613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319206066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1972725475]“没有破相啦，全部都治好了，不疼了，没事的”安娜温和的说着，随后抱住了你，脑袋盖进了她的胸怀"}
{"time": 1771861640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341812890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我之前倒是答应了你不拦着你。”斟酌着用词，有点别扭地开口“但是问问应该不影响。你现在感觉，怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1771861810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170891590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"抱着安娜，安心地闭着眼，\"下次不会了...我这次什么都没做...其他人呢?\"有些自责"}
{"time": 1771861828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969656823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“.........比想象中的更”夜鸦斟酌了下用词“轻松”"}
{"time": 1771861951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664048558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“校长，你现在在校长室吗”#给自己和拉洁娜泡杯咖啡"}
{"time": 1771861964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1015099087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=924851293]顺便你联系到了校长，确实就在校长室"}
{"time": 1771861993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356318249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=170891590]“没关系啦，大家做的很好，仙仙姐不用逼紧自己”"}
{"time": 1771862025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035355638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但你刚刚说的话很吓人。”看着锅里，但是眼神完全没聚焦“我不知道现在到底是谁在和我说话。是夜鸦？还是黑根？”"}
{"time": 1771862090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467766503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我去找一下校长”#去一下校长室吧，正好让拉洁娜休息一下"}
{"time": 1771862101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702257308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"打开手镯的联系，问一下队友"}
{"time": 1771862104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629952600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "情况"}
{"time": 1771862131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964924251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“解决了，不出意外的话，是圆满完成”"}
{"time": 1771862143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771648259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“但是可能存在两个王”"}
{"time": 1771862169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792385490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2035355638]“我们之间的差别，不远............我还是我，只是我也更了解它了”夜鸦伸出刚刚割开了的手腕，拉开绷带，你看到里面的伤口已经完全愈合了，过程大概会是肉眼可见，不知道究竟会是怎样的"}
{"time": 1771862189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596630019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那个小屁孩嘴里念叨什么哥哥”"}
