{"time": 1771862250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779513980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=792385490]“不行，我不放心。”摇摇头，抬起手来伸向她“让我确认一下吧，好吗？”"}
{"time": 1771862262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685260602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=467766503]那么你匆匆忙忙的赶到了校长室，昂热正好为自己，还有你都倒了杯酒"}
