{"time": 1771862770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635833722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过放心吧，龙王会处理干净的”#端起酒杯敬他一下"}
