{"time": 1771865507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554584900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我知道...\"哽咽一直止不住，\"有过这样的事情...我担心...担心...再也见不到安娜...大家...\"抱着更紧了一些，眼泪立刻濡湿了一片被褥"}
{"time": 1771865749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622393889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=385399228]“我……不，我不会”抓住她的手“我会找到我的办法”"}
{"time": 1771865797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005705352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不论是灵魂，还是存在，我会以我自己的方法抓住它”"}
