{"time": 1771943795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114981890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我们是外国人，来这边旅行就察觉到异常能量，唉，秉持着安全就来看看”"}
{"time": 1771943804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408658347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我叫帕特森”"}
{"time": 1771943824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030562351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“咒术师……”好有地方特色的名字，印象里用咒术的都不算什么好人，遂摇头“我不是咒术师”"}
{"time": 1771943829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358920285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...不奏效啊。\"看着帕特森，\"我叫仙仙...刚刚路过...真的。\""}
{"time": 1771943833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973541131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不认识高专的咒术师........吗？外国人”他稍微思考了下“确实偶尔会有这种状况........不过居然那么巧”"}
{"time": 1771943939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189351245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那个夏什么的，是谁?\""}
