{"time": 1771943951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190270722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯........那么你们先在这里等吧，我还有事情要办，之后再介绍给你们”"}
{"time": 1771943957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792144903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“你知道这个&#91;夏&#93;是谁吗”"}
