{"time": 1771946393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432434192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“过来就好啦，这里有住的地方的，还有温泉哦”"}
{"time": 1771946454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546502887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“温泉，那也太好了，那我们过一会到，正好和先生你见一面”"}
{"time": 1771946578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600884983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“让七海搭你们过来吧”"}
{"time": 1771946604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529662667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“嗯，七海先生，五条悟先生让你带我们过去参加什么交流会”"}
{"time": 1771946714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665551475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“交流会？那不是学生吗，真是乱来”七海边吐槽也没多抱怨什么直接带着你们驱车过去，从凌晨5点到中午12点才到，你们看到面前是个有着护城河的城堡连着座山"}
{"time": 1771946757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "752181003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“没想到要这么久呀，开了足足7小时”"}
{"time": 1771946770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588917428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还是出差.jpg）"}
