{"time": 1772024760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593882896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（是的，你们要作为两个旧人类和一个新人类VS龙神）"}
{"time": 1772024773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614663292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“两位校长好”"}
{"time": 1772024776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825871218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（何意味）"}
{"time": 1772024895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52314957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1772024907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267330434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "夜蛾边说着边走到了一个黑板前，你们看到上面贴着九张符纸“没想到还会有外国咒术师过来参观，还想和我学交流赛，就让我来介绍规则吧”"}
{"time": 1772025078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065782786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“好的，麻烦你了”"}
{"time": 1772025083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069455298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“赛场内会投放八个准二级咒灵，以及一个二级咒灵，你们三个队伍会从三个地点入场，最后比拼哪个队伍解决的咒灵更多，当然，场内要尽量避免伤亡，这场交流会的作用，也正是为了磨合两校学生之间的友谊，也欢迎你们的加入”"}
{"time": 1772025170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "752103033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“原来如此”#思索，只要击杀咒灵呀"}
{"time": 1772025223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653108304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，还有什么问题吗？”"}
{"time": 1772025231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691319635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我们没问题，不过有我们要注意的地方吗”"}
{"time": 1772025274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270557440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯。”"}
{"time": 1772025285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802198523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“比如哪里不能去之类的”"}
{"time": 1772025299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246075179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“只要不离开场内就好，各队伍之间可能会有战斗，但是请别留下大伤”"}
{"time": 1772025370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385094129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“了解”#帕特森比个ok，看向队友“你们有什么问题吗”"}
{"time": 1772025376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868267308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] [CQ:at,qq=2275904091]"}
