{"time": 1772178012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933086697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"不知道到底这次是什么情况"}
{"time": 1772178038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "113849733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "之后你们稍等了下，看到虎子出现在了法阵的正中央，随后光又立刻暗淡了下去"}
{"time": 1772178069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213632621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "虎子看到你们时候愣了下“哦哇，你们什么时候来的，好久不见”然后走过来给你们每个人都抱了抱"}
{"time": 1772178073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699561820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“传送类的法阵啊”点点头，倒是不陌生"}
{"time": 1772178085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571260635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“好久？”"}
{"time": 1772178093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007492211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我们这次间隔了多久？”"}
{"time": 1772178102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633786291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们光看着能注意到和上次见面虎子的差别就是他的腰间揣着个本子，似乎是中文词典"}
{"time": 1772178144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155966531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我们已经一年不见了，不知道为什么很和平，但是老师一直找不到”"}
{"time": 1772178162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454777286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“?”"}
{"time": 1772178178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080423890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你们不在的时候发生了很多事”忧忧这时在旁边说了句“啊，去里面聊吧”"}
{"time": 1772178189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264399156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“带路吧”"}
{"time": 1772178195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403401582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(我们是不是并不知道)"}
{"time": 1772178196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135404777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一年?嗯...聊聊吧\""}
{"time": 1772178197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262960202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "他指了指里边的那个房间，你们上次也来过，其实就是讲交流会规则时的房间"}
{"time": 1772178204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136086800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(五条悟是某人的老师)"}
{"time": 1772178213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127252592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（知道啊）"}
{"time": 1772178237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471408102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（五条是高专东京部的老师，歌姬是京都的）"}
{"time": 1772178339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112596510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们跟着虎子还有忧忧进了那间房去"}
{"time": 1772178354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417292943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "进去之后分别找了个位置坐下，忧忧站在讲台后和你们说"}
{"time": 1772178369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215703217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:json,data={\"ver\":\"1.0.0.19\"&#44;\"prompt\":\"&#91;QQ小程序&#93;鸣潮玩家从3.0到3.1 be like...&#91;RandoWis&#93;\"&#44;\"config\":{\"type\":\"normal\"&#44;\"width\":0&#44;\"height\":0&#44;\"forward\":1&#44;\"autoSize\":0&#44;\"ctime\":1772178362&#44;\"token\":\"8d81b6bb6e31fc95699be81f52357adc\"}&#44;\"needShareCallBack\":false&#44;\"app\":\"com.tencent.miniapp_01\"&#44;\"view\":\"view_8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"meta\":{\"detail_1\":{\"appid\":\"1109937557\"&#44;\"appType\":0&#44;\"title\":\"哔哩哔哩\"&#44;\"desc\":\"鸣潮玩家从3.0到3.1 be like...&#91;RandoWis&#93;\"&#44;\"icon\":\"http:\\/\\/miniapp.gtimg.cn\\/public\\/appicon\\/432b76be3a548fc128acaa6c1ec90131_200.jpg\"&#44;\"preview\":\"https:\\/\\/qq.ugcimg.cn\\/v1\\/br4c7p2aqns7ostgadqcov8f7nu23i7uqs09bnkepa53s6qhqmkmo5qqn8hu3v9cc99u20mi604pbo0hobsi035o385s0q1tlukj7d3chmu0rpillek3o0ij0lv984uit77r9ppinpiagi8ujrolh4ds84\\/e9vf2tsqr6j29hl2kodb3vahlc\"&#44;\"url\":\"m.q.qq.com\\/a\\/s\\/77cc99f1f28dc1b484f1a08e9e3c5efe\"&#44;\"scene\":1036&#44;\"host\":{\"uin\":2275904091&#44;\"nick\":\"冰黎曦\"}&#44;\"shareTemplateId\":\"8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"shareTemplateData\":{}&#44;\"qqdocurl\":\"https:\\/\\/b23.tv\\/Yvinp5m?share_medium=android&amp;share_source=qq&amp;bbid=XY8358281257C10303836FEC93957CA5566EE&amp;ts=1772178361694\"&#44;\"showLittleTail\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePoints\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePointsUrl\":\"\"&#44;\"shareOrigin\":0}}}]"}
{"time": 1772178380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526922479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“大概是两个星期前，我的术式意外传送到了并非原地目标的地方”"}
{"time": 1772178402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "928618263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#略有所思"}
{"time": 1772178423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485512481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“哦，你们不知道，我的术式是空间传送，在你们离开之后有关召唤系的法术也是我在研究，不过有关契约的部分被切割出去了”"}
{"time": 1772178429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102508917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“空间不稳？”"}
{"time": 1772178478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037947888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“并非日本的地方，但我认识，那是中国，真正奇怪的是那里的咒力，或者应该说魔力了，能量相当的平衡”"}
{"time": 1772178510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890276048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\""}
{"time": 1772178518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537994211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，召唤系，唉，空间系。\""}
{"time": 1772178536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207102108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“?”"}
{"time": 1772178539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977007457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#两眼一黑"}
{"time": 1772178575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496916327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“自那之后，以前怎么也不可能跨越的事情，也就是跨越世界，被实现了。大概在七天前高专建立了特别调查组其中的成员分别是伏黑惠，虎杖悠仁，钉崎野蔷薇，通过这个传送阵前往异世界进行调查”"}
{"time": 1772178578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952079298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“魔力？有正常的正能量？”"}
{"time": 1772178602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229349017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是的，我们憧憬的世界”"}
{"time": 1772178630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455339073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我突然觉得，所有这方面的法术都该被封锁才对。\""}
{"time": 1772178669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469793328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这个事情现在知道的人还不多，未来会派越来越多的术师去调查，如果这是好事我们会照单会收，但如果是坏事，我们需要想办法制止”"}
{"time": 1772178677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106478836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“。。。据我所知，跨世界的结局都不好”"}
{"time": 1772178681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192884286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“然后就是第二件事”"}
{"time": 1772178681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756785089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#唉"}
{"time": 1772178699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73830628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你们应该先前认识虎杖，现在对他的感觉有什么特别的吗”"}
{"time": 1772178705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964196617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也就是说”对某个指控按下不表“那个传送阵通向一个时代相近的另一个中国？”"}
{"time": 1772178724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308451115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "虎杖听到念到自己了，就在旁边摆起了pose"}
{"time": 1772178726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389508643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#看一下虎杖，有什么不同的感觉吗"}
{"time": 1772178735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230417217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（魔力感知？）"}
{"time": 1772178774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850271505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"转头看向他"}
{"time": 1772178777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566500897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=964196617]“是的，那个世界当然也有，除了中国之外的其他国家，不过，直至目前为止，我们仍然在调查为什么不是在异世界的同个地点”"}
{"time": 1772178805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772987366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1230417217][CQ:at,qq=961142868] 魔力感知"}
{"time": 1772178817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753744604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么你们感觉到虎杖有非常明显的提升，现在已经40级了"}
{"time": 1772178842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394981617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“嗯，一年之间进步飞快呀”"}
{"time": 1772178846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118403304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“啊，说起来，你们可能不知道，我已经觉醒术式了”虎杖在旁边看起来还挺开心的和你们解释“是在三个月前的事情”"}
{"time": 1772178852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560107434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（空间人的优势是升级）"}
{"time": 1772178859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "613768999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（结果现在自信心没了）"}
{"time": 1772178861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803624352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“觉醒术式?”"}
{"time": 1772178862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812955759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（唉）"}
{"time": 1772178873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097831561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（血脉能力没办法的啦）"}
{"time": 1772178907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511385804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“基本是日本范围内，或者说世界范围内，因为我们没有多少国外人可以对比”忧忧继续解说着“咒术师实力都相对有了一定的提升”"}
{"time": 1772178913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923546557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你看萧炎成帝，萧潇直接斗圣了）"}
{"time": 1772178917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153974981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“?”"}
{"time": 1772178941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567457517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“什么?咒术师的集体提升?”"}
