{"time": 1772180237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607420261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（召唤一次不就知道了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1772180241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074161325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我们有考虑这种可能，两天后学会了引路术的咒术师会和你们出发去另一个世界尝试”"}
{"time": 1772180287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809933953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“啊，我已经问好了！”虎杖在走廊探出了半个身子冲着你们挥了挥手，示意可以出发了"}
{"time": 1772180469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929639084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嘛，那也是之后的事了”夜蛾点了点头，也没有缠着你们说话的意思，似乎想让你们离开了"}
{"time": 1772180481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488523707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起身跟着虎杖"}
