{"time": 1772185406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270333836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_wookZXMjLH5kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ0lwX5Le5xnJOeBhd84NIK3oCrAGCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMH0ndsx3T-nbL_J8tns4xv4IbYFV2aIOsgCuaVamWsZsVMSR11eRh-LSglDqy3kFnA,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1772185408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540834534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，虽说由我来说感觉有些越俎代庖，不过...之后会越来越麻烦的。\"抬起头，合上手机郑重开口，\"一定要做好准备。\""}
{"time": 1772185487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805924091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“啊？和我说吗........”路明非只感觉莫名其妙，完全没接你的气氛。楚子航这时候看了眼手机说“我们接下来要去上海了，校长说会在你们定的旅馆里见”"}
{"time": 1772185506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811400098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，明白……啊，对了。师兄有没有收到过什么消息？在这龙都，近期有没有发生过怪事？”"}
{"time": 1772185508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1178299625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“彳亍”"}
{"time": 1772185515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428618837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那，我也一起咯?\"站起身，拉起安娜，\"猫猫?\""}
