{"time": 1772198137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406657513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "—————————————"}
{"time": 1772198190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776373587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "华，帕特森，夜鸦你们三人去往了定的旅馆，然而刚到门口就看到，门是开着的，那老风骚的男人昂热还在里边坐在床上玩着折刀"}
{"time": 1772198195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430114480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "另一边坐飞机去了"}
{"time": 1772198295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584218036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#拧开一瓶早餐奶，麦香的早餐奶真好喝“要喝些什么吗”"}
{"time": 1772198308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179442067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=430114480]（当然这边要等会）"}
{"time": 1772198313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554128059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#拉过来一个椅子，跨坐着"}
{"time": 1772198334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836189088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#让人偶站在身后端着餐盘"}
{"time": 1772198350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014093039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来）"}
{"time": 1772198359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1986503342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我们好像，并不知道校长是武将啊（）"}
{"time": 1772198361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467761760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你知道我最想听的不是这个”昂热边说着，拿过了瓶早餐奶“对老人家来说，骨子太硬也不是好事”"}
{"time": 1772198428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749273277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“唉，我们现在去的世界不知道为什么和这个世界相连了”"}
{"time": 1772198459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283586426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“校长确实应该有很多问题想问我们。”*站着总比坐着灵活一些“虽然说这个有些轻飘，但是辛苦了”"}
{"time": 1772198460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535714196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“里面有类似怨灵的怪物可能跑到这边来了”"}
{"time": 1772198574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535607473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“怨灵？我没有收到这种报告...........不”昂热稍微沉思了片刻“最近这附近的失踪案确实上升了许多。你的意思是现在有个怨灵通过录像靠着电视来吃人？”"}
{"time": 1772198639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933604931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不，他们是由人类负面产生的，一般人看不见他们，也不是电视传播，而是现实”#帕特森思索一下"}
{"time": 1772198647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382209053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（昂热多少级）"}
{"time": 1772198663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073459590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（29）"}
{"time": 1772198666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137872477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么贞子）"}
{"time": 1772198683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522905221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我反应了半天什么电视剧）"}
{"time": 1772198685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85071282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（电视机）"}
{"time": 1772198753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662337088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2073459590]（混血种不血界突破的话只能29）"}
{"time": 1772198779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404474934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你说的，包括混血种吗？”"}
{"time": 1772198809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578542654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森思索一下“他们的实力很强，抬手便能操控大片树木袭击敌人”"}
{"time": 1772198816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681114194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“大概……噢……”后知后觉想起来什么很严重的事情"}
{"time": 1772198843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027463233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果先前咒灵的主要来源是，日本的民间怪谈和传说……”"}
{"time": 1772198871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867739344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1404474934]“混血种我不确定能不能见到他们，不过学会魔法的应该可以看见，那边的咒力就是负面的魔力。。。不过楚子航的说魔法和他言灵产生的共鸣，或许掌握了言灵的混血种可以看见他们”"}
{"time": 1772198876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829221789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那么联通到这边之后，该不会有什么……龙形咒灵什么的……”"}
{"time": 1772198908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929495352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*脸色突然变得有点难看"}
{"time": 1772198911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929839552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1829221789][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “别说这么可怕的事情好吗”"}
{"time": 1772198914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615453432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#叹口气"}
{"time": 1772198927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "89320398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "听到华说的话之后昂热皱起了眉头“你们确认会在这个世界诞生吗？而不是在另一个世界”"}
{"time": 1772198991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904960247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不清楚”*摇头“但是我们在那边遇到过的朋友说，那边最恶的咒灵……们，已经许久没有动静了。这很反常”"}
{"time": 1772199024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921987197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“即便不考虑在这里诞生咒灵的可能，那些偷渡过来的家伙们也需要处理的”"}
{"time": 1772199066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311357828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“最恶？像是龙王那样吗”"}
{"time": 1772199113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143750139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“是打算将人类毁灭的那样”"}
{"time": 1772199125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151469723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，据说有的能代表天灾”"}
{"time": 1772199163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171726392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我们这次原本就是去解决那边的问题的。只是没想到联通到了这边”"}
{"time": 1772199255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1183418987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“毁灭人类？”昂热的神色沉了下来“告诉我，你们想怎么做？”"}
{"time": 1772199346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392786523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我们自然是，坚定站在人类一侧的”"}
{"time": 1772199350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790065084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吧）"}
{"time": 1772199378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534672516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“找到那些咒灵，他们手中有个叫做狱门疆的道具，其中封印了那个世界的人类最高战力，想办法夺过来解除封印”"}
{"time": 1772199397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041607734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过这过程可能会死很多人，我们也会上的”"}
{"time": 1772199413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963627636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我们始终站在人类的一方”"}
{"time": 1772199425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639809997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "昂热听着帕特森说的话，显然精神不太集中，毕竟他也听不懂，但很快，他抛出了另一个话题“那诺顿的事呢？你们该对我解释了”"}
{"time": 1772199460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274851386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“诺顿的灵魂被我们带走了，这或许是你们提炼不出贤者之石的原因？”"}
{"time": 1772199469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776858005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我们好像一直没有说过”"}
{"time": 1772199477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799855164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“灵魂是我们的通用货币”"}
{"time": 1772199490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742717229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#挠头，有些不好意思的说道"}
{"time": 1772199523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827827601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得那也不重要（）"}
