{"time": 1772199533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655888853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“灵魂是记载了很多知识的载体，我们的上神将这个载体作为了通用货币”#敲了敲自己身上的防具"}
{"time": 1772199556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096944149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“这个就是用其中一部分换取的防具”"}
{"time": 1772199559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635289539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;挠头&#93;,file=8B0E04D189B61A5ACFA7AB7FDE45CEAD.jpg,sub_type=7,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQj0XU1yFlAdDN3Yb11Nyvggm1e2RiwECD_CiiciZ3p5fmSAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhAg_ZgxJ7nZ6sHnqieejqlbegLR2YIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAISMCi-LuVKyoQCLhSd1z8EUMSB0PAEAXxTfbrr0o2TEKzpKV24tWk5XdYEClIJfBNLfg,file_size=2096]"}
{"time": 1772199579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "444028453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你们有能证明的办法吗？”"}
{"time": 1772199612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607638332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我原本倒是打算……直接下手的”目光有些游离“但是玖茗说她她对那个看起来一脸懵懂的男人下不去手”"}
{"time": 1772199650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555919009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“证明的办法……”思索“校长想确定的是哪方面？龙王的去向，还是灵魂的存在？”"}
{"time": 1772199712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123276837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“引路术我留下来过，效果校长你应该知道”#伸手“那个龙王我见过，引路术要是他在这个世界，那就能找到他吧”"}
{"time": 1772199741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894248657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后发现只有路明非能用？）"}
