{"time": 1772199800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545382041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#使用引路术"}
{"time": 1772199820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120901294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（龙王应该没有回来吧，希望康斯坦丁没有回来龙族世界）"}
{"time": 1772199842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481747337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（为心中所想指引方向。消耗10MP，于手心出现一个箭头，指引目标方向。持续10S。目标为自身所见过的具体的物，人，且其等级不高于30级，没有命运相关的能力，不为神器。\n消耗增加10点，每点APP加值提高搜索目标1级（最多50级），每点智力加值提高持续时间5S。当幸运加值达到4点时，可指引的目标可以是概念性事物，不再需要自己见过（如，我的宿敌，能杀死我的东西，杀人犯...），当结果为多个时，箭头会分裂成多个，此时需要消耗20点幸运（24H后恢复），当幸运加值达到8点时，该技能对神以下起效。当智力加值达到4点时，箭头会显示大致的距离。\t\n）"}
{"time": 1772199845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947216756", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "引路术没用，这是理所应当的，毕竟那里啊，人不在这个世界，当然其实要是这两人，就算在这个世界，只要恢复为龙重获半神的位格之后你这个技能也毫无作用"}
{"time": 1772199858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260042236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "引路术没用，这是理所应当的，毕竟那里二人不在这个世界，当然其实要是这两人，就算在这个世界，只要恢复为龙重获半神的位格之后你这个技能也毫无作用"}
{"time": 1772199881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538458063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "不过显然他们也没研究那么明白，毕竟他们也用不出"}
{"time": 1772199889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212198680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过。。。狱门疆。。。我或许可以用引路术去寻找狱门疆”"}
{"time": 1772199914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133218332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“要不要试试看寻找”"}
{"time": 1772199918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602215149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "昂热点了点头“我暂且相信你们，但是要有个人去和校董事见面”"}
{"time": 1772199929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604169931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你们这次会呆多久？”"}
{"time": 1772199937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706448911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（哦，这次是七天）"}
{"time": 1772199983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864917142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“没有意外的话是七天”"}
{"time": 1772199996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626499867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“校董会吗，需要我去吗”"}
{"time": 1772200024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309402451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一周……但这次要做的事情很多”*叹气“龙都是和那边最直接相连的地方。如果可以，我们还是希望能节约点时间”"}
{"time": 1772200070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156406627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "昂热忽然又打断了你们的话“到底谁去这个话题最后决定吧，我还有另一个问题，另一个世界是怎样的？”"}
{"time": 1772200138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669994749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”想了想“多少有些相似，同样存在一批不抛头露面的特殊人类，掌握着称为‘咒术’的负能量”"}
{"time": 1772200164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948754759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“时代和地理分布都几乎一样吧”"}
{"time": 1772200199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470961738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“科技相似，星球相似，差距的话就是这边是龙那边是咒灵，如何要比起来，那边比起这个更加糟糕，身处其中就和在粪坑里面一样”"}
{"time": 1772200215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180063805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“负能量？会有什么特殊的影响吗”"}
{"time": 1772200243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334858260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“有，治愈性质的魔法使用不了”"}
{"time": 1772200254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23929047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“最显著的影响是，难以施展治愈类的魔法。以及，天道……或者说，世界意志吧，对善恶的倾向相反”"}
{"time": 1772200272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403308384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“而且天道似乎对人类抱有恶意”"}
{"time": 1772200286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1150891598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过这边的世界意志……上一次我们来的时候，我确认过，似乎并不明显”"}
{"time": 1772200297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588709150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "昂热这个老神棍望着你们的神色中露出了看到神棍的神情“天道，你们相信这种事物存在？”"}
{"time": 1772200307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194998314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*给帕特森一个“要再试试吗？”的眼神"}
{"time": 1772200352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840213924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“其实我也不确定，那是否是一个有知性的个体。说不定叫做机制更合适？”"}
{"time": 1772200374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148346191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“至少我从未亲眼见过，但也确实受过影响”"}
{"time": 1772200384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098311395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“但是这是真实存在的，校长，或许你不相信，但是天道也是我们最终可以抵达的程度，不过现在这个世界的天道似乎在沉睡，也不知道为什么，如果可以的话唤醒他后会简单很多”"}
{"time": 1772200396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462915232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（不对，天道在睡觉，我的引路术没用吧）"}
{"time": 1772200427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436854162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“这种事情我们没有必要欺骗”"}
{"time": 1772200497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2049403031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果这种事情真的存在，那我就得信神了”"}
{"time": 1772200515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839051628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“不”"}
{"time": 1772200520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392609728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你们刚刚说，你们是从另一个世界过来的，你们是怎么过来的，走过一扇门吗？”"}
