{"time": 1772202500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989517608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“发生什么了？”他问"}
{"time": 1772202548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068995501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1429881503]（给他永葆青春一下（）"}
{"time": 1772202645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1574554869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“因为这个世界本身就有除了人类以外的异类---龙，原本这边的天道沉睡着，现在似乎有苏醒的迹象，可能是两边世界融合的结果，现在就担心龙和咒灵产生什么化学反应”"}
{"time": 1772202730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161316136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“诶，龙。守着财宝会吐火的那个？”虎杖格外感兴趣的问"}
{"time": 1772202757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385384496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“难道还会抢公主？”钉崎在旁边补充了句，也不知道是不是认真的"}
{"time": 1772202771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369357956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“额，各种各样的都有，不过大多都是人类的敌人”"}
