{"time": 1772208779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388956996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说笑的啦，我现在对自己的认知很清晰啦，玩火柴的小女孩。\"坐起来，\"但是任务在上海诶?上海有什么有趣的事情吗？\""}
{"time": 1772208784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591548461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(话说引路术对这种启用吗)"}
{"time": 1772208794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626743416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1167348246]（是）"}
{"time": 1772208812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776139773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“说是什么百鬼夜行”"}
{"time": 1772208831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072469945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“吃人的巷子，实现祈愿的巷子”"}
