{"time": 1772208921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843490912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“有些可疑”"}
{"time": 1772208991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246681390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谁知道?百鬼夜行什么的，遇见的话，就放把火烧个干净好啦。\"抱着枕头，在卡塞尔的论坛里找茬，发个帖，然后干脆发个约战芬格尔的帖子。"}
{"time": 1772209016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694561212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“咱们在都市，你可别把人家房子烧了”"}
